(1102802, 133983, 10658, '<td valign="top">I love the idea, I''d certainly like to kill off my bills :)  I don''t think the time in the bottom right hand corner adds to the composition unfortunately.  Another thing detracting from the image is that the focus isn''t sharp.  Still, it''s a unique idea and I wish you luck! :)</td>', 'I love the idea, I''d certainly like to kill off my bills :)  I don''t think the time in the bottom right hand corner adds to the composition unfortunately.  Another thing detracting from the image is that the focus isn''t sharp.  Still, it''s a unique idea and I wish you luck! :)', '2005-01-12 00:32:10.000000', NULL, 1),
