(1103793, 133983, 27845, '<td valign="top">Christ, I almost didn''t understand it! It''s obvious :) I think it would have done better without the DVDs and with a tighter crop. Make sure to switch off the date watermrking function for your next entry, the red text is really distractoing. 4.</td>', 'Christ, I almost didn''t understand it! It''s obvious :) I think it would have done better without the DVDs and with a tighter crop. Make sure to switch off the date watermrking function for your next entry, the red text is really distractoing. 4.', '2005-01-12 10:59:02.000000', NULL, 1),
