(1103798, 133776, 27845, '<td valign="top">Cute! Good lighting, nice soft colurs, the dog''s head is sharp and the background is just as soft as it should be, good DOF. Some snow would have improved the picture. 6.</td>', 'Cute! Good lighting, nice soft colurs, the dog''s head is sharp and the background is just as soft as it should be, good DOF. Some snow would have improved the picture. 6.', '2005-01-12 11:01:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1103801, 133540, 27845, '<td valign="top">Good picture, might be a little sharper (maybe I''m just seeing things). The colour is interesting, not the clichee red. But why did you add that border? A single, black line would have been much better. 6.</td>', 'Good picture, might be a little sharper (maybe I''m just seeing things). The colour is interesting, not the clichee red. But why did you add that border? A single, black line would have been much better. 6.', '2005-01-12 11:02:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1103803, 135424, 27845, '<td valign="top">I see only one bright light and no city, but I don''t know whether there''s a movie called ''Bright Light''. A tighter crop on the fireworks would have been good. 3.</td>', 'I see only one bright light and no city, but I don''t know whether there''s a movie called ''Bright Light''. A tighter crop on the fireworks would have been good. 3.', '2005-01-12 11:03:57.000000', NULL, 1),
