(1103808, 135082, 27845, '<td valign="top">I don''t know whether ''delicatessen'' has the same meaning in English as it has in Luxembourgian, French or German, but if it has, I don*t see the link between the picture and the title. Looks like you missed the challenge. PM me _after the voting is over_ if I''m wrong. 3.</td>', 'I don''t know whether ''delicatessen'' has the same meaning in English as it has in Luxembourgian, French or German, but if it has, I don*t see the link between the picture and the title. Looks like you missed the challenge. PM me _after the voting is over_ if I''m wrong. 3.', '2005-01-12 11:06:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1103810, 133960, 27845, '<td valign="top">Needs some rightness and contrast. I don''t see a storm, so the link to the movie is shaky, but oh well. I don''t know why you rotated the picture, it looks strange. 3.</td>', 'Needs some rightness and contrast. I don''t see a storm, so the link to the movie is shaky, but oh well. I don''t know why you rotated the picture, it looks strange. 3.', '2005-01-12 11:07:38.000000', NULL, 1),
