(1103962, 135084, 22734, '<td valign="top">This is certainly a very good concept and the presentation is very expressive. I have given a 6. This is simply my opinion: whenever we employ such an expressive silhoutte there is no need to um it until the halo becomes an inherent part of the image. Outside of this the idea is very well presented. More will flow where this comes from as the imagination is very fertile.</td>', 'This is certainly a very good concept and the presentation is very expressive. I have given a 6. This is simply my opinion: whenever we employ such an expressive silhoutte there is no need to um it until the halo becomes an inherent part of the image. Outside of this the idea is very well presented. More will flow where this comes from as the imagination is very fertile.', '2005-01-12 12:19:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1103966, 134970, 31443, '<td valign="top">I like the subtle light on the snow, very nice!</td>', 'I like the subtle light on the snow, very nice!', '2005-01-12 12:20:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1103967, 134541, 31610, '<td valign="top">Cute!</td>', 'Cute!', '2005-01-12 12:20:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1103968, 134975, 22734, '<td valign="top">A great action image with good style.</td>', 'A great action image with good style.', '2005-01-12 12:20:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1103969, 133755, 6999, '<td valign="top">Beeautiful scene - and beautifully captured too. I like your processing choices, in the end. At first my thought was that you could happily have used more contrast here, but such a hauntingly gentle scene really does work better this way. It takes measuring to be certain, but after a few moments looking there''s an impression of a tilted horizon, which for me adds an unfortunate dynamic that doesn''t help the image. But still - love the processing, the choices you''ve made, and the image generally. 8</td>', 'Beeautiful scene - and beautifully captured too. I like your processing choices, in the end. At first my thought was that you could happily have used more contrast here, but such a hauntingly gentle scene really does work better this way. It takes measuring to be certain, but after a few moments looking there''s an impression of a tilted horizon, which for me adds an unfortunate dynamic that doesn''t help the image. But still - love the processing, the choices you''ve made, and the image generally. 8', '2005-01-12 12:21:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1103973, 135163, 29148, '<td valign="top">Cute. I''ll take your word for that that is lamb. An 8</td>', 'Cute. I''ll take your word for that that is lamb. An 8', '2005-01-12 12:22:54.000000', NULL, 1),
