(1104302, 135144, 6999, '<td valign="top">Strong image, good choice of title too. Immaculate use of depth of field, and a strong compositional balance across the frame. It''s possibly a touch too purely graphic for my taste (and this really is now about personal taste): there isn''t enough definition in those ducklings to add that extra level of wit to it. nevertheless, strong work. 7</td>', 'Strong image, good choice of title too. Immaculate use of depth of field, and a strong compositional balance across the frame. It''s possibly a touch too purely graphic for my taste (and this really is now about personal taste): there isn''t enough definition in those ducklings to add that extra level of wit to it. nevertheless, strong work. 7', '2005-01-12 15:09:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1104304, 133533, 9821, '<td valign="top">cute kid ... if you move the seat forward away from the back, the shadow would not be visible ... would improve it much, i think</td>', 'cute kid ... if you move the seat forward away from the back, the shadow would not be visible ... would improve it much, i think', '2005-01-12 15:09:52.000000', NULL, 1),
