(1104308, 134045, 6999, '<td valign="top">You have a difficulty with light here i think; the eye naturally being drawn to the brightest areas of frame (although there are other considerations, naturally, but with such deep depth of field they don''t come into this very strongly), the primary point of attention in your shot is the bas of the chair. There''s a tension introduced by another natural instinct which is to see the faces, and the pull between those two things. Sometimes that can be a successful technique, that division of attention, bu for me there''s nothing fascinating about the base of the chair ... 5</td>', 'You have a difficulty with light here i think; the eye naturally being drawn to the brightest areas of frame (although there are other considerations, naturally, but with such deep depth of field they don''t come into this very strongly), the primary point of attention in your shot is the bas of the chair. There''s a tension introduced by another natural instinct which is to see the faces, and the pull between those two things. Sometimes that can be a successful technique, that division of attention, bu for me there''s nothing fascinating about the base of the chair ... 5', '2005-01-12 15:12:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1104310, 135569, 9821, '<td valign="top">i thought all pizza looked good ... until now :)<br/>i don''t think i understand the photo ... is the box and cloth cut away?</td>', 'i thought all pizza looked good ... until now :)i don''t think i understand the photo ... is the box and cloth cut away?', '2005-01-12 15:13:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1104311, 134320, 9821, '<td valign="top">cool shot ... i think a darker sky would have been good, too</td>', 'cool shot ... i think a darker sky would have been good, too', '2005-01-12 15:13:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1104314, 134435, 6999, '<td valign="top">Choosing to frame this scene this way seems odd: given the intriguing tonality of the sky, even despite it''s seeming so blocky and compressed, I would have imagined placing that line of buildings lower in frame and allowing the effect of the sky not to be so constricted would have added an enormous amount to this - especially as you have so much dead space in frame at the bottom. 5</td>', 'Choosing to frame this scene this way seems odd: given the intriguing tonality of the sky, even despite it''s seeming so blocky and compressed, I would have imagined placing that line of buildings lower in frame and allowing the effect of the sky not to be so constricted would have added an enormous amount to this - especially as you have so much dead space in frame at the bottom. 5', '2005-01-12 15:14:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1104315, 135226, 9821, '<td valign="top">looks like you used the negative filter ... i think i would like it better if just black and white and then boost the contrast way up</td>', 'looks like you used the negative filter ... i think i would like it better if just black and white and then boost the contrast way up', '2005-01-12 15:14:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1104316, 135177, 9821, '<td valign="top">nice texture, good sky ... but there isn''t too much to look at ... it''s nice, though</td>', 'nice texture, good sky ... but there isn''t too much to look at ... it''s nice, though', '2005-01-12 15:15:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1104317, 134898, 9821, '<td valign="top">flash is a little bright ... good idea, though</td>', 'flash is a little bright ... good idea, though', '2005-01-12 15:15:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1104320, 135508, 9821, '<td valign="top">very nice ... i''d like to see less sky and more forground</td>', 'very nice ... i''d like to see less sky and more forground', '2005-01-12 15:16:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1104321, 134972, 9821, '<td valign="top">i know the "fallen" piece was necessary for the shot ... but the most interesting part is the grafic you created with the other pieces</td>', 'i know the "fallen" piece was necessary for the shot ... but the most interesting part is the grafic you created with the other pieces', '2005-01-12 15:17:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1104322, 134399, 6999, '<td valign="top">As a set up for a propaganda image this is ideal. To my eye, your execution of it could have been improved with the use of levels or histogram adjustments to really take that background to black, and probably also by using a softer and more angled light, which I think would help provide a threatening sheen on the gun, and prevent that glare on the bullet. Not an image I like, I''m afraid - it''s too straighforward and obvious a message for me, akin to being battered over the head. But neatly done. 5</td>', 'As a set up for a propaganda image this is ideal. To my eye, your execution of it could have been improved with the use of levels or histogram adjustments to really take that background to black, and probably also by using a softer and more angled light, which I think would help provide a threatening sheen on the gun, and prevent that glare on the bullet. Not an image I like, I''m afraid - it''s too straighforward and obvious a message for me, akin to being battered over the head. But neatly done. 5', '2005-01-12 15:17:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1104324, 134252, 9821, '<td valign="top">looks muddy ... like actual mud ... nice composition</td>', 'looks muddy ... like actual mud ... nice composition', '2005-01-12 15:18:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1104325, 134778, 15207, '<td valign="top">This is stunning. I hope you win. 10</td>', 'This is stunning. I hope you win. 10', '2005-01-12 15:18:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1104326, 134180, 6999, '<td valign="top">I''m taking this as a reference to your camera? What is this, from a phone? I just can''t vote this kind of quality very highly ... and there isn''t anything strong enough for me in the image to push it past that.</td>', 'I''m taking this as a reference to your camera? What is this, from a phone? I just can''t vote this kind of quality very highly ... and there isn''t anything strong enough for me in the image to push it past that.', '2005-01-12 15:20:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1104331, 135489, 31443, '<td valign="top">Stunning light!</td>', 'Stunning light!', '2005-01-12 15:22:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1104334, 133990, 2022, '<td valign="top">Cool (10)</td>', 'Cool (10)', '2005-01-12 15:24:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1104336, 134420, 6999, '<td valign="top">Pretty neat, and you lighting isn''t too bad - there''s quite a strong sense of the various textures. It isn''t, for me, a very succcessful challenge entry - but I''m struggling to say why exactly: I think it is a question of weak composition in the end: there''s a tension between the spoon and the ducks, which actually adds to the strength of the area of frame where the bowl is, and somehow it is that that becomes the central subject - the ducks are weak, die to their central placing, the spoon because of being out of focus, and the bowl seems like the least important part of the image. I wonder if a less horizontal viewpoint might have strengthened the image? Nice try though</td>', 'Pretty neat, and you lighting isn''t too bad - there''s quite a strong sense of the various textures. It isn''t, for me, a very succcessful challenge entry - but I''m struggling to say why exactly: I think it is a question of weak composition in the end: there''s a tension between the spoon and the ducks, which actually adds to the strength of the area of frame where the bowl is, and somehow it is that that becomes the central subject - the ducks are weak, die to their central placing, the spoon because of being out of focus, and the bowl seems like the least important part of the image. I wonder if a less horizontal viewpoint might have strengthened the image? Nice try though', '2005-01-12 15:27:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1104337, 135241, 31332, '<td valign="top">Very nice photo</td>', 'Very nice photo', '2005-01-12 15:28:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1104338, 134374, 6999, '<td valign="top">I''m sure I won''t be the first, but <i>hairy</i> potter, surely? Neatly posed and lit studio image, although I dislike the black table-top, it seems too blank and textureless , and yet contrasts so heavily with the background, almost as though you couldn''t choose between black and white. Beyond that, it''s too contrived for my taste, and i think the hand-prints and the litle bits of clay overcook things. 5</td>', 'I''m sure I won''t be the first, but hairy potter, surely? Neatly posed and lit studio image, although I dislike the black table-top, it seems too blank and textureless , and yet contrasts so heavily with the background, almost as though you couldn''t choose between black and white. Beyond that, it''s too contrived for my taste, and i think the hand-prints and the litle bits of clay overcook things. 5', '2005-01-12 15:31:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1104343, 135244, 30505, '<td valign="top">mmmmm...love sashimi!</td>', 'mmmmm...love sashimi!', '2005-01-12 15:33:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1104344, 134652, 31332, '<td valign="top">Is this Mexico?</td>', 'Is this Mexico?', '2005-01-12 15:33:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1104345, 134178, 15207, '<td valign="top">This is one of the best in the bunch. The reflections are just amazing. Love the B&amp;W effect. 10</td>', 'This is one of the best in the bunch. The reflections are just amazing. Love the B&W effect. 10', '2005-01-12 15:34:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1104347, 134201, 15207, '<td valign="top">One of my favorites. This is gorgeous. Love the way the sun is hidden in the fog/clouds adn the beautiful silhouettes. Very haunting and deserving of that great movie title. 10</td>', 'One of my favorites. This is gorgeous. Love the way the sun is hidden in the fog/clouds adn the beautiful silhouettes. Very haunting and deserving of that great movie title. 10', '2005-01-12 15:34:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1104348, 134198, 15207, '<td valign="top">If you don''t get a ribbon I''ll be very surprised. This is very compelling and dramatic. It''s so unique and innovative I can''t stop looking at it. Love the saturation effects too. 10</td>', 'If you don''t get a ribbon I''ll be very surprised. This is very compelling and dramatic. It''s so unique and innovative I can''t stop looking at it. Love the saturation effects too. 10', '2005-01-12 15:35:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1104349, 135344, 15207, '<td valign="top">Love the simplicity here and, of course, the colour and theme. 10</td>', 'Love the simplicity here and, of course, the colour and theme. 10', '2005-01-12 15:35:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1104350, 133756, 30505, '<td valign="top">would like to see this without the border.</td>', 'would like to see this without the border.', '2005-01-12 15:35:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1104351, 134696, 6999, '<td valign="top">The light, especially in the area of the cards and the knife, is lovely ... but i really wish you hadn''t included so very much <i>stuff</i> in the shot. Together with the really very bright candles it makes it a difficult image to look at for long ... there is too much to remove the eye from the cards, and not enough to hold the attention once drawn. Simpler is very often better, and can communicate just as much if carefully composed. 5</td>', 'The light, especially in the area of the cards and the knife, is lovely ... but i really wish you hadn''t included so very much stuff in the shot. Together with the really very bright candles it makes it a difficult image to look at for long ... there is too much to remove the eye from the cards, and not enough to hold the attention once drawn. Simpler is very often better, and can communicate just as much if carefully composed. 5', '2005-01-12 15:35:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1104352, 135014, 15207, '<td valign="top">Brilliant 10</td>', 'Brilliant 10', '2005-01-12 15:36:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1104353, 135432, 15207, '<td valign="top">Really uncanny resemblance. Love the way you put in all the details, including the hair clip. Well shot and composed. It''s perfect. 10</td>', 'Really uncanny resemblance. Love the way you put in all the details, including the hair clip. Well shot and composed. It''s perfect. 10', '2005-01-12 15:37:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1104354, 134151, 15207, '<td valign="top">This is a national geographic calibre image. I hope you do well - and I hope you turn this into a print and submit it to other competitions as well. It''s brilliant. 10</td>', 'This is a national geographic calibre image. I hope you do well - and I hope you turn this into a print and submit it to other competitions as well. It''s brilliant. 10', '2005-01-12 15:37:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1104355, 133883, 15207, '<td valign="top">One of the most unique images I''ve seen. Love this. 10</td>', 'One of the most unique images I''ve seen. Love this. 10', '2005-01-12 15:37:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1104356, 134450, 15207, '<td valign="top">This is breathtaking. I''ve never seen something like this done so well. Love everything about it. 10</td>', 'This is breathtaking. I''ve never seen something like this done so well. Love everything about it. 10', '2005-01-12 15:38:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1104357, 135551, 15207, '<td valign="top">Pitch perfect in every way. 10</td>', 'Pitch perfect in every way. 10', '2005-01-12 15:38:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1104358, 133764, 31332, '<td valign="top">I would like to have seen the whole owl. Nice photo though.</td>', 'I would like to have seen the whole owl. Nice photo though.', '2005-01-12 15:38:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1104361, 134615, 6999, '<td valign="top">And I was expecting it to be Mary Poppins, but then no Nanny appeared. I like this, there''s a certain lunatic (in a nice way) edge to the composition. A shame that that hedge line couldn''t be cleaner - it feels halfway an accidental inclusion (although obviously not) for being so disorganised. The very featureless sky doesn''t really help this kind of stuff, either, I think: the very madness of it requires a big bright sky, I would think. I know, you can''t choose your weather; but ... well, the image still cries out for it, to me. 6</td>', 'And I was expecting it to be Mary Poppins, but then no Nanny appeared. I like this, there''s a certain lunatic (in a nice way) edge to the composition. A shame that that hedge line couldn''t be cleaner - it feels halfway an accidental inclusion (although obviously not) for being so disorganised. The very featureless sky doesn''t really help this kind of stuff, either, I think: the very madness of it requires a big bright sky, I would think. I know, you can''t choose your weather; but ... well, the image still cries out for it, to me. 6', '2005-01-12 15:39:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1104362, 135339, 15207, '<td valign="top">WOW WOW WOW!!! This is so cool.  10</td>', 'WOW WOW WOW!!! This is so cool.  10', '2005-01-12 15:39:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1104363, 134327, 15207, '<td valign="top">I really like this and I love the light shadows. 10</td>', 'I really like this and I love the light shadows. 10', '2005-01-12 15:40:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1104366, 134617, 31332, '<td valign="top">I''m not familiar with the movie, but this is a nice photo.</td>', 'I''m not familiar with the movie, but this is a nice photo.', '2005-01-12 15:40:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1104372, 135232, 31658, '<td valign="top">nice shot.</td>', 'nice shot.', '2005-01-12 15:42:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1104373, 133983, 18191, '<td valign="top">Good pun.</td>', 'Good pun.', '2005-01-12 15:43:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1104376, 135003, 30505, '<td valign="top">seems to be a bit out of focus.  Otherwise beautiful</td>', 'seems to be a bit out of focus.  Otherwise beautiful', '2005-01-12 15:44:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1104378, 134795, 25218, '<td valign="top">I had to check imdb.com, cause I didn''t know of such a movie! The exposure is very good, but the composition is kind of lacking, I think. Hope you''re not too affected by the high water!</td>', 'I had to check imdb.com, cause I didn''t know of such a movie! The exposure is very good, but the composition is kind of lacking, I think. Hope you''re not too affected by the high water!', '2005-01-12 15:45:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1104379, 134601, 31658, '<td valign="top">nice. nice atmosphere</td>', 'nice. nice atmosphere', '2005-01-12 15:45:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1104384, 135450, 6999, '<td valign="top">Looking at the various shades of grey in your background, i would suggest that your monitor might be set somewhat too dark.</td>', 'Looking at the various shades of grey in your background, i would suggest that your monitor might be set somewhat too dark.', '2005-01-12 15:46:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1104385, 134998, 20809, '<td valign="top">great soft focus, still life - 7</td>', 'great soft focus, still life - 7', '2005-01-12 15:46:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1104386, 135251, 27845, '<td valign="top">strange colours, looks weird... I don''t see the link to the title either...3.</td>', 'strange colours, looks weird... I don''t see the link to the title either...3.', '2005-01-12 15:46:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1104387, 134948, 13749, '<td valign="top">poweful and striking image - well done.  unfortunately, your style and nudity probably won''t be accepted well =( - but i think it''s a fantastic shot and to heck with what anyone else thinks! ;)</td>', 'poweful and striking image - well done.  unfortunately, your style and nudity probably won''t be accepted well =( - but i think it''s a fantastic shot and to heck with what anyone else thinks! ;)', '2005-01-12 15:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1104389, 135568, 25218, '<td valign="top">Great movie! Parker Posey is just not in enough films, in think. Very cool effect with the lighting, and the shades. Great idea!</td>', 'Great movie! Parker Posey is just not in enough films, in think. Very cool effect with the lighting, and the shades. Great idea!', '2005-01-12 15:48:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1104390, 134499, 27845, '<td valign="top">How about ''The Birds'' by Hitchcock :) I love the colour gradient. 9.</td>', 'How about ''The Birds'' by Hitchcock :) I love the colour gradient. 9.', '2005-01-12 15:48:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1104391, 134711, 31658, '<td valign="top">nice color and composition</td>', 'nice color and composition', '2005-01-12 15:48:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1104392, 135324, 6999, '<td valign="top">I only wish you could have matched the detail and sense of texture you''ve caught on the pot in her face; it just seems a little out of focus, or blurred, and a touch too dark. For all that, a lovely study of concentration and artistry - the shaping a moulding of her left hand adds a fine touch. The noise levels might have leant themselves to a black and white presentation, perhaps?</td>', 'I only wish you could have matched the detail and sense of texture you''ve caught on the pot in her face; it just seems a little out of focus, or blurred, and a touch too dark. For all that, a lovely study of concentration and artistry - the shaping a moulding of her left hand adds a fine touch. The noise levels might have leant themselves to a black and white presentation, perhaps?', '2005-01-12 15:48:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1104397, 135093, 27845, '<td valign="top">Awesome sky. Interestong composition. 7.</td>', 'Awesome sky. Interestong composition. 7.', '2005-01-12 15:49:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1104398, 135184, 2022, '<td valign="top">Great picture (10)</td>', 'Great picture (10)', '2005-01-12 15:49:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1104399, 134483, 31658, '<td valign="top">beautiful. a little more contrast meybe.</td>', 'beautiful. a little more contrast meybe.', '2005-01-12 15:49:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1104400, 135523, 27845, '<td valign="top">So that child is god? ;) 8.</td>', 'So that child is god? ;) 8.', '2005-01-12 15:50:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1104401, 135154, 31658, '<td valign="top">hillarous title. nice shot</td>', 'hillarous title. nice shot', '2005-01-12 15:50:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1104406, 134258, 31658, '<td valign="top">weired angle</td>', 'weired angle', '2005-01-12 15:52:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1104408, 135591, 27845, '<td valign="top">Really creative. A bit blurry though, and needs some contrast and brightness. 5.</td>', 'Really creative. A bit blurry though, and needs some contrast and brightness. 5.', '2005-01-12 15:52:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1104411, 134414, 31332, '<td valign="top">The rider and bike look a little aggressive to be an easy rider.Nice shot though.</td>', 'The rider and bike look a little aggressive to be an easy rider.Nice shot though.', '2005-01-12 15:54:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1104414, 135292, 29783, '<td valign="top">very clever.</td>', 'very clever.', '2005-01-12 15:56:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1104415, 135139, 27845, '<td valign="top">Huh? ''Das Boot'' is a German war movie and has nothing to do with bondage! By the way, the costumes are dusty. 2.</td>', 'Huh? ''Das Boot'' is a German war movie and has nothing to do with bondage! By the way, the costumes are dusty. 2.', '2005-01-12 15:56:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1104422, 134955, 27845, '<td valign="top">Cool, funny, blue. 10.</td>', 'Cool, funny, blue. 10.', '2005-01-12 16:00:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1104424, 134335, 20809, '<td valign="top">Nice, but I think Sepia of B&amp;W would have enhanced the mood some more</td>', 'Nice, but I think Sepia of B&W would have enhanced the mood some more', '2005-01-12 16:00:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1104427, 135593, 27845, '<td valign="top">You might at least have called it ''The Birds'', that''s closer to the movie title. 3.</td>', 'You might at least have called it ''The Birds'', that''s closer to the movie title. 3.', '2005-01-12 16:01:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1104428, 134196, 20809, '<td valign="top">Well which one is it?</td>', 'Well which one is it?', '2005-01-12 16:02:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1104432, 134399, 27845, '<td valign="top">Wow. With a white background, this would be great as stock photography. I like the message. 7.</td>', 'Wow. With a white background, this would be great as stock photography. I like the message. 7.', '2005-01-12 16:04:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1104433, 135533, 31133, '<td valign="top">Pretty contrast between the palm silhouette and the sunlight.</td>', 'Pretty contrast between the palm silhouette and the sunlight.', '2005-01-12 16:04:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1104434, 135280, 27845, '<td valign="top">Welcome to the Clockwork Orange Club :)</td>', 'Welcome to the Clockwork Orange Club :)', '2005-01-12 16:04:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1104437, 135339, 31133, '<td valign="top">Very nice!</td>', 'Very nice!', '2005-01-12 16:05:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1104438, 134568, 27845, '<td valign="top">Uargh! That''s so damn ugly. Cool. 6.</td>', 'Uargh! That''s so damn ugly. Cool. 6.', '2005-01-12 16:05:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1104440, 135146, 27845, '<td valign="top">Did you know that Einstein could neither read nor write until he was in the fourth grade? Good shot nonetheless. 7.</td>', 'Did you know that Einstein could neither read nor write until he was in the fourth grade? Good shot nonetheless. 7.', '2005-01-12 16:06:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1104441, 135274, 31133, '<td valign="top">Very good job on the title. Matches the tree perfectly. Nice job.</td>', 'Very good job on the title. Matches the tree perfectly. Nice job.', '2005-01-12 16:07:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1104442, 135487, 31133, '<td valign="top">Good title, beautiful depth between the cliff and the sea. It feels like I''m about to fall in!</td>', 'Good title, beautiful depth between the cliff and the sea. It feels like I''m about to fall in!', '2005-01-12 16:07:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1104443, 134450, 30505, '<td valign="top">This is very nice!  Would love to know how you did this.</td>', 'This is very nice!  Would love to know how you did this.', '2005-01-12 16:08:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1104444, 133983, 31610, '<td valign="top">You didn''t need the movie box in the picture to get your point across. Also, you may want to turn off your date stamp if you can, or shoot the pic with enough room on the right side so you can crop the time stamp off of the picture.</td>', 'You didn''t need the movie box in the picture to get your point across. Also, you may want to turn off your date stamp if you can, or shoot the pic with enough room on the right side so you can crop the time stamp off of the picture.', '2005-01-12 16:08:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1104445, 135194, 31133, '<td valign="top">haha, cute. There''s a little hair and water bubble by the stool, though. But that''s probably from Rocky''s sweat and fighting.</td>', 'haha, cute. There''s a little hair and water bubble by the stool, though. But that''s probably from Rocky''s sweat and fighting.', '2005-01-12 16:09:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1104447, 134795, 31133, '<td valign="top">Nice colors, good title for the shot, and I like the crop.</td>', 'Nice colors, good title for the shot, and I like the crop.', '2005-01-12 16:10:19.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(1104449, 134179, 31133, '<td valign="top">Great! Makes me homesick for Seattle :-(  but I like this picture a lot.</td>', 'Great! Makes me homesick for Seattle :-(  but I like this picture a lot.', '2005-01-12 16:11:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1104452, 135084, 31133, '<td valign="top">Creative - and the colors are so perfect. A slightly thinner frame would be nice. I don''t really get why these might be the hands of fate, but I like the picture!</td>', 'Creative - and the colors are so perfect. A slightly thinner frame would be nice. I don''t really get why these might be the hands of fate, but I like the picture!', '2005-01-12 16:12:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1104453, 135012, 29079, '<td valign="top">very clever and funny, nicely photographed</td>', 'very clever and funny, nicely photographed', '2005-01-12 16:13:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1104454, 133776, 30505, '<td valign="top">beautiful dog.  Wish you could have fixed the top right corner of the photo it''s a bit of a distraction.</td>', 'beautiful dog.  Wish you could have fixed the top right corner of the photo it''s a bit of a distraction.', '2005-01-12 16:14:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1104455, 135195, 3741, '<td valign="top">wonderfully creative!</td>', 'wonderfully creative!', '2005-01-12 16:14:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1104456, 134692, 31133, '<td valign="top">This is one of my favorites so far! It really captures all things good about being young. Okay, I think this is my favorite so far for sure.</td>', 'This is one of my favorites so far! It really captures all things good about being young. Okay, I think this is my favorite so far for sure.', '2005-01-12 16:14:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1104457, 133776, 31610, '<td valign="top">pretty puppy</td>', 'pretty puppy', '2005-01-12 16:14:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1104459, 133707, 31610, '<td valign="top">This pic reminds me of the movie about middle earth</td>', 'This pic reminds me of the movie about middle earth', '2005-01-12 16:15:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1104461, 135191, 31133, '<td valign="top">I think this looks like a good start of something interesting, but I feel like it would be nice wiith maybe just one bush in the frame or more depth or something (I''m sorry that I''m not so great at commenting, but I''m not a good photographer - just trying to give my little opinion because I like to get them myself :-)</td>', 'I think this looks like a good start of something interesting, but I feel like it would be nice wiith maybe just one bush in the frame or more depth or something (I''m sorry that I''m not so great at commenting, but I''m not a good photographer - just trying to give my little opinion because I like to get them myself :-)', '2005-01-12 16:16:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1104462, 135080, 3741, '<td valign="top">i like the cropping. makes it visually interesting</td>', 'i like the cropping. makes it visually interesting', '2005-01-12 16:16:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1104463, 135032, 3741, '<td valign="top">an all around good composition</td>', 'an all around good composition', '2005-01-12 16:17:15.000000', NULL, 1),
