(1104570, 134178, 6999, '<td valign="top">This is comment number 2000. Thought I''d just mark that little landmark. And a very fine image to bring that up with too. There''s a lot that I really like here too - the composition, the mystery, the sense of solitude, and space. it may onyl be a optical illusion, but there''s a sense of the image being slightly tilted to the right that doesn''t help the feel - even if it is an optical illusion, surely a touch of rotation to the left might have eased that sense? A beautiful shot, nevertheless. Top work.</td>', 'This is comment number 2000. Thought I''d just mark that little landmark. And a very fine image to bring that up with too. There''s a lot that I really like here too - the composition, the mystery, the sense of solitude, and space. it may onyl be a optical illusion, but there''s a sense of the image being slightly tilted to the right that doesn''t help the feel - even if it is an optical illusion, surely a touch of rotation to the left might have eased that sense? A beautiful shot, nevertheless. Top work.', '2005-01-12 16:57:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1104571, 134013, 3741, '<td valign="top">a wonderful concept, and i like that it''s greyscale, but the execution could have been better, (but hey, you can hold up your own foot only so long/still, right?).</td>', 'a wonderful concept, and i like that it''s greyscale, but the execution could have been better, (but hey, you can hold up your own foot only so long/still, right?).', '2005-01-12 16:57:51.000000', NULL, 1),
