(1104776, 134918, 4226, '<td valign="top">the picture is not sharp enough for this kind of closeup shot. I like the water drops on neck. <br/>somehow the intersection of the swan and water seems too artificial.</td>', 'the picture is not sharp enough for this kind of closeup shot. I like the water drops on neck. somehow the intersection of the swan and water seems too artificial.', '2005-01-12 18:26:03.000000', NULL, 1),
