(1105401, 135280, 28585, '<td valign="top">I like the composition, not so sure about the marker-drawn clock. fresh and clear image</td>', 'I like the composition, not so sure about the marker-drawn clock. fresh and clear image', '2005-01-13 04:42:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1105402, 134414, 28585, '<td valign="top">quite far from the original in outfit and technological equipement.... why is your model squinting? is he not EASY?</td>', 'quite far from the original in outfit and technological equipement.... why is your model squinting? is he not EASY?', '2005-01-13 04:43:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1105404, 135146, 28585, '<td valign="top">I''m sure he/she is your little Einstein, but the face says "I don''t have a clue why daddy put me here"!  Composition is nice, but the blackboard looks a bit like it is floating, maybe the baby''s hand in front of it (a little higher than it is now) could have made this pic even better</td>', 'I''m sure he/she is your little Einstein, but the face says "I don''t have a clue why daddy put me here"!  Composition is nice, but the blackboard looks a bit like it is floating, maybe the baby''s hand in front of it (a little higher than it is now) could have made this pic even better', '2005-01-13 04:46:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1105405, 135255, 28585, '<td valign="top">whoa... really coming at you. good capture with the low light and all.</td>', 'whoa... really coming at you. good capture with the low light and all.', '2005-01-13 04:47:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1105407, 134335, 28585, '<td valign="top">lighting and comp are nice, was there someone in the shower when you shot this?</td>', 'lighting and comp are nice, was there someone in the shower when you shot this?', '2005-01-13 04:48:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1105408, 134260, 28585, '<td valign="top">good shot, but you focused on the hat rim. a bit noisy</td>', 'good shot, but you focused on the hat rim. a bit noisy', '2005-01-13 04:49:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1105409, 133938, 6999, '<td valign="top">The silhouetting of theat house/barn and the trees adds a sense of mystery, certainly, and I enjoy the light on the water, and in the smaller bushes. Slight downside: having to push the exposure as far as you have, some of that glare on the water is perhaps a bit strong? you composition is the weakest element of the image though: i can''t see that lifting the camera a touch would have harmed the exposure - though I suppose the sun might have begun to flare - but the very bottom part of frame seems to add little, and the cutting off of the trees at the top <i>does</i> harm things: and especially when you end up with that building placed a little weak in frame.</td>', 'The silhouetting of theat house/barn and the trees adds a sense of mystery, certainly, and I enjoy the light on the water, and in the smaller bushes. Slight downside: having to push the exposure as far as you have, some of that glare on the water is perhaps a bit strong? you composition is the weakest element of the image though: i can''t see that lifting the camera a touch would have harmed the exposure - though I suppose the sun might have begun to flare - but the very bottom part of frame seems to add little, and the cutting off of the trees at the top does harm things: and especially when you end up with that building placed a little weak in frame.', '2005-01-13 04:49:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1105410, 134759, 28585, '<td valign="top">No, it''s dirt cheap! Ah sorry, good pun. Nice shot of tender loins.</td>', 'No, it''s dirt cheap! Ah sorry, good pun. Nice shot of tender loins.', '2005-01-13 04:49:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1105412, 134955, 28585, '<td valign="top">keep on runnin''... composition is nice, a bit of sharpening would be nice</td>', 'keep on runnin''... composition is nice, a bit of sharpening would be nice', '2005-01-13 04:51:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1105413, 135576, 28585, '<td valign="top">not very striking, reflection in the windows distracts</td>', 'not very striking, reflection in the windows distracts', '2005-01-13 04:51:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1105415, 134337, 28585, '<td valign="top">beautiful colors, a little more ''ground'' I would have liked more personally</td>', 'beautiful colors, a little more ''ground'' I would have liked more personally', '2005-01-13 04:52:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1105417, 134012, 8860, '<td valign="top">This far and away my favourite of the challenge.<br/> <br/>It has everything a good photo should: a story, great technique, an excellent capture (right time - right place) and above all it''s a wonderful appraoch to the brief.<br/> <br/>The way the other bird looks on is priceless. You can shove your dodge + burn frenzies - this is real skill. Just love the relationship to the title too. [10]</td>', 'This far and away my favourite of the challenge. It has everything a good photo should: a story, great technique, an excellent capture (right time - right place) and above all it''s a wonderful appraoch to the brief. The way the other bird looks on is priceless. You can shove your dodge + burn frenzies - this is real skill. Just love the relationship to the title too. [10]', '2005-01-13 04:53:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1105418, 133820, 6999, '<td valign="top">Good exposure, which is tricky for snow. Good job you put that border in too - given the closeness to the dpc grey of most of it. I would wish that hte buildings weren''t there, they affect the sense of remoeness of the scene, the isolation. Use of negative space is very effective.</td>', 'Good exposure, which is tricky for snow. Good job you put that border in too - given the closeness to the dpc grey of most of it. I would wish that hte buildings weren''t there, they affect the sense of remoeness of the scene, the isolation. Use of negative space is very effective.', '2005-01-13 04:54:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1105419, 135083, 28585, '<td valign="top">nice combination of block pattern and repeating bullet pattern, striking</td>', 'nice combination of block pattern and repeating bullet pattern, striking', '2005-01-13 04:54:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1105421, 135124, 28585, '<td valign="top">the horse does not really pop out of the image, more bokeh would be better I think. composition: the horse looks cut off, it''s legs are about to come into the frame but just don''t</td>', 'the horse does not really pop out of the image, more bokeh would be better I think. composition: the horse looks cut off, it''s legs are about to come into the frame but just don''t', '2005-01-13 04:56:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1105422, 134894, 28585, '<td valign="top">beautiful, sharp, bright, nicely executed, good photo!</td>', 'beautiful, sharp, bright, nicely executed, good photo!', '2005-01-13 04:56:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1105425, 135486, 28585, '<td valign="top">sad but striking image, I like the shopping carts in the bg</td>', 'sad but striking image, I like the shopping carts in the bg', '2005-01-13 04:57:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1105426, 135252, 28585, '<td valign="top">It''s a Harley allright, but the guy on it does not look comfortable or easy at all. great dof takes attention away from the main subject</td>', 'It''s a Harley allright, but the guy on it does not look comfortable or easy at all. great dof takes attention away from the main subject', '2005-01-13 04:58:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1105428, 135307, 28585, '<td valign="top">nice misty atmosphere, but this is also the cause of little contrast and makes the pic look a little bland.</td>', 'nice misty atmosphere, but this is also the cause of little contrast and makes the pic look a little bland.', '2005-01-13 04:59:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1105430, 134320, 28585, '<td valign="top">this is not a composite? weird image, but not unappealing. got to know who sits on the stool though</td>', 'this is not a composite? weird image, but not unappealing. got to know who sits on the stool though', '2005-01-13 05:00:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1105431, 135274, 28585, '<td valign="top">indeed terribly complicated, it is almost too busy but then it has a kind of pattern of its own as well....</td>', 'indeed terribly complicated, it is almost too busy but then it has a kind of pattern of its own as well....', '2005-01-13 05:01:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1105432, 135079, 28585, '<td valign="top">very minimalist, but striking.</td>', 'very minimalist, but striking.', '2005-01-13 05:02:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1105433, 135519, 28585, '<td valign="top">you shot too many to give the viewer a point to focus on</td>', 'you shot too many to give the viewer a point to focus on', '2005-01-13 05:02:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1105435, 135495, 28585, '<td valign="top">if you intended to keep the lid text in, ok, but cropping it out is no harm either. nice nostalgic look you have created.</td>', 'if you intended to keep the lid text in, ok, but cropping it out is no harm either. nice nostalgic look you have created.', '2005-01-13 05:03:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1105436, 134367, 28585, '<td valign="top">a little sharpening would have been nice, duck is a bit expression-less</td>', 'a little sharpening would have been nice, duck is a bit expression-less', '2005-01-13 05:04:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1105437, 135177, 28585, '<td valign="top">famous rocks, good picture, nice</td>', 'famous rocks, good picture, nice', '2005-01-13 05:04:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1105440, 135090, 28585, '<td valign="top">good, gooey feel to your bubbles. I like the us of dof very much. too bad the foam blew out in some places. dark and disconcerting pic...</td>', 'good, gooey feel to your bubbles. I like the us of dof very much. too bad the foam blew out in some places. dark and disconcerting pic...', '2005-01-13 05:05:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1105441, 134199, 28585, '<td valign="top">too busy, at first sight there is a nice cheesy feel to the atmosphere, but the table is too full and the curtains on the right melt together with the table cloth</td>', 'too busy, at first sight there is a nice cheesy feel to the atmosphere, but the table is too full and the curtains on the right melt together with the table cloth', '2005-01-13 05:07:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1105457, 134601, 31820, '<td valign="top">Excellent interpretation of the theme, a little more space in front of the Engine would give more af a feeling of movement.<br/>A slight crop at the right hand side would position the subject better wihin the frame.<br/>I love the very slight Blue Tone. Very well Done.</td>', 'Excellent interpretation of the theme, a little more space in front of the Engine would give more af a feeling of movement.A slight crop at the right hand side would position the subject better wihin the frame.I love the very slight Blue Tone. Very well Done.', '2005-01-13 05:28:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1105458, 134560, 11270, '<td valign="top">This is lovely,I like the water droplets.</td>', 'This is lovely,I like the water droplets.', '2005-01-13 05:29:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1105463, 135533, 11270, '<td valign="top">Dramatic sky reflecting the water. A postcard picture, very nice.</td>', 'Dramatic sky reflecting the water. A postcard picture, very nice.', '2005-01-13 05:33:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1105467, 135186, 27812, '<td valign="top">Not a bad pic at all, just do not like the noise...<br/> <br/>Returning to look at this again... There is definately some background noise that does not compliment your blade.  The idea is good and so the lighting on the blade. I really like the play of red, it actually creates the pic. If not for this background noise, could have scored it much higher. All said, bumping up on merit.</td>', 'Not a bad pic at all, just do not like the noise... Returning to look at this again... There is definately some background noise that does not compliment your blade.  The idea is good and so the lighting on the blade. I really like the play of red, it actually creates the pic. If not for this background noise, could have scored it much higher. All said, bumping up on merit.', '2005-01-13 05:38:23.000000', NULL, 1),
