(1106203, 135555, 14656, '<td valign="top">Too dark. Almost everything except for the axe and hat are invisible (and even those are hard to see). Would''ve liked to see the shirt in better lighting and well as more light on the glasses. My monitor is calibrated and even when cranking up the brightness to the max, I still had a hard time seeing.</td>', 'Too dark. Almost everything except for the axe and hat are invisible (and even those are hard to see). Would''ve liked to see the shirt in better lighting and well as more light on the glasses. My monitor is calibrated and even when cranking up the brightness to the max, I still had a hard time seeing.', '2005-01-13 16:21:33.000000', NULL, 1),
