(1106241, 135462, 14656, '<td valign="top">Focus appears soft from motion blur. Blurry knife distracting.</td>', 'Focus appears soft from motion blur. Blurry knife distracting.', '2005-01-13 16:36:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1106243, 135583, 14656, '<td valign="top">Beautriful dreamy feel. Glow on bottom left a bit much but works. Definitely like the feel of this one.</td>', 'Beautriful dreamy feel. Glow on bottom left a bit much but works. Definitely like the feel of this one.', '2005-01-13 16:37:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1106244, 135503, 31133, '<td valign="top">eeewwww. The stuff in the lower left between the peel and the meat (right next to a strong white spot) is distracting. An appropriate title.</td>', 'eeewwww. The stuff in the lower left between the peel and the meat (right next to a strong white spot) is distracting. An appropriate title.', '2005-01-13 16:37:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1106247, 134973, 14656, '<td valign="top">I''m not feeling the postprocessing on this one. Pink tones and attempt at soft focus detract heavily from this image.</td>', 'I''m not feeling the postprocessing on this one. Pink tones and attempt at soft focus detract heavily from this image.', '2005-01-13 16:38:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1106249, 134198, 3032, '<td valign="top">I like the effect created here, but the oval border bugs me a bit. <br/>Concerning the border: I like the concept and the framing effect, but the transition from black to photo is so hard. Especially when you see the shadows that go from black to blue in a nice soft way. I don''t know if it had been basic rules legal, but a softer transition on the border (feathering it) might be preferable.<br/>The image: The lines of the staircase draw me deeper and deeper. The people on the stairs give direction, add movement and flow, enhance the perspective and give scale. I think that even without the people it still might look good. The person looking upwards, standing still = interesting.</td>', 'I like the effect created here, but the oval border bugs me a bit. Concerning the border: I like the concept and the framing effect, but the transition from black to photo is so hard. Especially when you see the shadows that go from black to blue in a nice soft way. I don''t know if it had been basic rules legal, but a softer transition on the border (feathering it) might be preferable.The image: The lines of the staircase draw me deeper and deeper. The people on the stairs give direction, add movement and flow, enhance the perspective and give scale. I think that even without the people it still might look good. The person looking upwards, standing still = interesting.', '2005-01-13 16:39:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1106250, 133855, 14656, '<td valign="top">Love the lights on the ceiling. Wondering why some of the lights are green? Image appears slightly overexposed.</td>', 'Love the lights on the ceiling. Wondering why some of the lights are green? Image appears slightly overexposed.', '2005-01-13 16:39:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1106251, 135043, 31133, '<td valign="top">This is great. Everything is positioned so nicely. It fits the challenge perfectly, plus nice shot. Not sure about the shadow in the upper left, but that''s just nit-picky.</td>', 'This is great. Everything is positioned so nicely. It fits the challenge perfectly, plus nice shot. Not sure about the shadow in the upper left, but that''s just nit-picky.', '2005-01-13 16:39:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1106253, 135280, 14656, '<td valign="top">Nice. I think you could''ve zoomed/cropped closer to the orange clock..</td>', 'Nice. I think you could''ve zoomed/cropped closer to the orange clock..', '2005-01-13 16:40:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1106254, 134617, 3032, '<td valign="top">Great use of repetitive pattern and color. Very good. There is no clear subject in the photo itself, but the lines and patterns are entertaining on their own. 9</td>', 'Great use of repetitive pattern and color. Very good. There is no clear subject in the photo itself, but the lines and patterns are entertaining on their own. 9', '2005-01-13 16:41:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1106256, 135432, 14656, '<td valign="top">The model''s bangs appears to have stolen the focus from the face. Definite retro feel to this one.</td>', 'The model''s bangs appears to have stolen the focus from the face. Definite retro feel to this one.', '2005-01-13 16:42:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1106258, 134178, 3032, '<td valign="top">Good exposure. I like the composition and how the light falls. The little bit of mist adds that bit of interest to make it good. A person on the pier might have worked even better.</td>', 'Good exposure. I like the composition and how the light falls. The little bit of mist adds that bit of interest to make it good. A person on the pier might have worked even better.', '2005-01-13 16:42:52.000000', NULL, 1),
