(1106260, 134013, 31133, '<td valign="top">Nice shoe. I like the contrast between the train motion and the stillness of the rest of the shot. The reflection at the top and middle of your shoe is a bit distracting, I guess primarily due to it seeming to fight with the lights just beyond your toes.</td>', 'Nice shoe. I like the contrast between the train motion and the stillness of the rest of the shot. The reflection at the top and middle of your shoe is a bit distracting, I guess primarily due to it seeming to fight with the lights just beyond your toes.', '2005-01-13 16:43:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1106261, 135036, 14656, '<td valign="top">Dramatic lighting, nice composition.</td>', 'Dramatic lighting, nice composition.', '2005-01-13 16:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1106263, 134386, 31133, '<td valign="top">I like to see a little sharper detail, but please take my comment with a grain of salt, because I have a horrible monitor and it could be that I''m missing something.</td>', 'I like to see a little sharper detail, but please take my comment with a grain of salt, because I have a horrible monitor and it could be that I''m missing something.', '2005-01-13 16:44:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1106264, 134975, 14656, '<td valign="top">Rider''s helmet and front fork has some blur. Could''ve cropped a bit more off the top.</td>', 'Rider''s helmet and front fork has some blur. Could''ve cropped a bit more off the top.', '2005-01-13 16:45:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1106266, 134450, 14656, '<td valign="top">WOW! Beautiful lighting, sharp focus, pleasing composition. My ribbon pick!</td>', 'WOW! Beautiful lighting, sharp focus, pleasing composition. My ribbon pick!', '2005-01-13 16:46:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1106267, 133855, 31133, '<td valign="top">A little too light for my taste, or maybe it''s just that the pink things are too light. The ceiling really makes this picture.</td>', 'A little too light for my taste, or maybe it''s just that the pink things are too light. The ceiling really makes this picture.', '2005-01-13 16:46:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1106268, 135445, 31133, '<td valign="top">Clever.</td>', 'Clever.', '2005-01-13 16:46:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1106270, 135199, 3032, '<td valign="top">Very interesting photo. The technical quality is very high.<br/>The shoes, the wonderful shoes (shoes is to cheap a word for such footwear) tell their own story this way, just like your title says. The woman, in focus, seems to invite the man, out of focus, to dance. The woman has already stepped onto the dance stage, while the man seems to move out of the shadows to join her.<br/>No wonder that I like the positioning and use of shadows and dof. The chessboard floor adds a lot of perspective and goes well with the shoes. Very good.</td>', 'Very interesting photo. The technical quality is very high.The shoes, the wonderful shoes (shoes is to cheap a word for such footwear) tell their own story this way, just like your title says. The woman, in focus, seems to invite the man, out of focus, to dance. The woman has already stepped onto the dance stage, while the man seems to move out of the shadows to join her.No wonder that I like the positioning and use of shadows and dof. The chessboard floor adds a lot of perspective and goes well with the shoes. Very good.', '2005-01-13 16:47:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1106271, 135274, 14656, '<td valign="top">Wow, sharp contrast. Very fitting title.</td>', 'Wow, sharp contrast. Very fitting title.', '2005-01-13 16:48:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1106272, 134541, 3032, '<td valign="top">The composition tells the story. It is good, it is funny. Well done.</td>', 'The composition tells the story. It is good, it is funny. Well done.', '2005-01-13 16:48:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1106273, 135280, 31133, '<td valign="top">There were some others with the same theme, but this is the best of the ones I''ve seen so far. You did a nice job on the clock.</td>', 'There were some others with the same theme, but this is the best of the ones I''ve seen so far. You did a nice job on the clock.', '2005-01-13 16:48:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1106275, 134836, 31905, '<td valign="top">amazing. love the white light effect. How''s that done?</td>', 'amazing. love the white light effect. How''s that done?', '2005-01-13 16:48:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1106277, 134351, 14656, '<td valign="top">White balance appears off or as a warming filter was used. Dark pieces get lost in the background, including the queen.</td>', 'White balance appears off or as a warming filter was used. Dark pieces get lost in the background, including the queen.', '2005-01-13 16:49:12.000000', NULL, 1),
