(1106281, 135145, 31133, '<td valign="top">A very, very beautiful shot. So glad the little boy is in it, with brightly colored clothes that make him stand out. The shadows of the cabannas are gorgeous.</td>', 'A very, very beautiful shot. So glad the little boy is in it, with brightly colored clothes that make him stand out. The shadows of the cabannas are gorgeous.', '2005-01-13 16:51:03.000000', NULL, 1),
