(1106284, 135451, 14656, '<td valign="top">Interesting choice of backlighting, I think it works here. Good DOF, would''ve liked to see brighter catchlight in the eyes.</td>', 'Interesting choice of backlighting, I think it works here. Good DOF, would''ve liked to see brighter catchlight in the eyes.', '2005-01-13 16:52:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1106285, 133711, 259, '<td valign="top">the background distracts from the subjects.  there''s too much going on behind them.</td>', 'the background distracts from the subjects.  there''s too much going on behind them.', '2005-01-13 16:53:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1106286, 134399, 31905, '<td valign="top">very apt and prefect. prefect score.</td>', 'very apt and prefect. prefect score.', '2005-01-13 16:53:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1106287, 133732, 31133, '<td valign="top">I''d love to see more focus in the nose. The left eye is good.</td>', 'I''d love to see more focus in the nose. The left eye is good.', '2005-01-13 16:53:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1106292, 134179, 259, '<td valign="top">the composition is really nice.   the shallow depth of field works very well here.</td>', 'the composition is really nice.   the shallow depth of field works very well here.', '2005-01-13 16:55:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1106293, 135171, 3032, '<td valign="top">As a composition and idea it is great, but...<br/>This is about a girl with a pearl earring and while you follow Vermeer''s way of lighting (the opposite site of the face facing the window light) I feel that there is not enough light on the left side of the face. The contrast between the left side and the right side is a bit too strong.<br/>Again, like Vermeer, the light in the eyes is at the outside of the pupils, but it might have worked better a little bit more inward.<br/>I have rated this a 9 because it is still a nice portrait and you follow Vermeer''s lighting actually. But for my feeling it misses that liitle bit extra, else it might have been a 10.<br/></td>', 'As a composition and idea it is great, but...This is about a girl with a pearl earring and while you follow Vermeer''s way of lighting (the opposite site of the face facing the window light) I feel that there is not enough light on the left side of the face. The contrast between the left side and the right side is a bit too strong.Again, like Vermeer, the light in the eyes is at the outside of the pupils, but it might have worked better a little bit more inward.I have rated this a 9 because it is still a nice portrait and you follow Vermeer''s lighting actually. But for my feeling it misses that liitle bit extra, else it might have been a 10.', '2005-01-13 16:55:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1106294, 135168, 25468, '<td valign="top">Very well done. ''nuff said</td>', 'Very well done. ''nuff said', '2005-01-13 16:56:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1106295, 133755, 31133, '<td valign="top">Nice depth and perspective. I like this picture more the longer I look at it.</td>', 'Nice depth and perspective. I like this picture more the longer I look at it.', '2005-01-13 16:56:50.000000', NULL, 1),
