(1106453, 135262, 20941, '<td valign="top">I love dogs...and snow! Good idea.  I would like to see this composed so that more of the German Shepherd were visible and perhaps closer to the Beagle so that there was less negative space in the center. I know...impossible to tell the dogs where to pose, but alot of shots then choosing the best may get you a better composition.</td>', 'I love dogs...and snow! Good idea.  I would like to see this composed so that more of the German Shepherd were visible and perhaps closer to the Beagle so that there was less negative space in the center. I know...impossible to tell the dogs where to pose, but alot of shots then choosing the best may get you a better composition.', '2005-01-13 18:15:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1106455, 135124, 31307, '<td valign="top">The background (especially the wheelbarrow) is a little distracting.</td>', 'The background (especially the wheelbarrow) is a little distracting.', '2005-01-13 18:15:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1106457, 135307, 31307, '<td valign="top">Mother nature really came through for you on this didn''t she?  The fog is awesome.</td>', 'Mother nature really came through for you on this didn''t she?  The fog is awesome.', '2005-01-13 18:16:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1106460, 135486, 31307, '<td valign="top">This is, as I am not the owner of the car, hilarious and just begging to have a picture taken of it!</td>', 'This is, as I am not the owner of the car, hilarious and just begging to have a picture taken of it!', '2005-01-13 18:18:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1106466, 134992, 31307, '<td valign="top">I''m sorry to say, but the subject for this shot is not particularly interesting to me.</td>', 'I''m sorry to say, but the subject for this shot is not particularly interesting to me.', '2005-01-13 18:20:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1106470, 134386, 31307, '<td valign="top">This is a neat shot, but it''s just a little annoying that I can''t see more detail on the boats.</td>', 'This is a neat shot, but it''s just a little annoying that I can''t see more detail on the boats.', '2005-01-13 18:23:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1106471, 134972, 31307, '<td valign="top">Nice shot!  The colors of the surface and background really lend themselves to that of a chess board: simple, sharp, black and white.</td>', 'Nice shot!  The colors of the surface and background really lend themselves to that of a chess board: simple, sharp, black and white.', '2005-01-13 18:25:26.000000', NULL, 1),
