(1106601, 135130, 26756, '<td valign="top">A great idea for a photo and a nice way to tie that idea to a movie title.  But I think your submission size is going to cost you.  The photo is a bit small and I think it also suffers from being a bit too busy.  To me, you could have conveyed the same idea by either focusing in much close on a smaller area, maybe even a single gravestone or even a part of one.  Just my two cents.</td>', 'A great idea for a photo and a nice way to tie that idea to a movie title.  But I think your submission size is going to cost you.  The photo is a bit small and I think it also suffers from being a bit too busy.  To me, you could have conveyed the same idea by either focusing in much close on a smaller area, maybe even a single gravestone or even a part of one.  Just my two cents.', '2005-01-13 20:09:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1106602, 134376, 6999, '<td valign="top">Technically highly proficient, although it lacks that edge of reach-out-and-touch-it detail somehow. Photographically ... well; it just doesn''t appeal to me. I''d want some kind of sensuality of light, or neatness of composition, or surprise with the level of detail, and I''m afraid I don''t get anything from this that takes it past being a technically proficient photograph. Nevertheless, that technicality get you some points.</td>', 'Technically highly proficient, although it lacks that edge of reach-out-and-touch-it detail somehow. Photographically ... well; it just doesn''t appeal to me. I''d want some kind of sensuality of light, or neatness of composition, or surprise with the level of detail, and I''m afraid I don''t get anything from this that takes it past being a technically proficient photograph. Nevertheless, that technicality get you some points.', '2005-01-13 20:10:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1106605, 134007, 24890, '<td valign="top">The editing along the sides are a bit distracting...</td>', 'The editing along the sides are a bit distracting...', '2005-01-13 20:12:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1106606, 134362, 24890, '<td valign="top">Great dog portrait. Looks alot like the shepard I grew up with. (10)</td>', 'Great dog portrait. Looks alot like the shepard I grew up with. (10)', '2005-01-13 20:14:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1106608, 134953, 24890, '<td valign="top">Splendid! (10)<br/> <br/>She is adoreable.</td>', 'Splendid! (10) She is adoreable.', '2005-01-13 20:14:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1106609, 134984, 6999, '<td valign="top">The idea is neat, but your lighting is (forgive my bluntness) dreadful. Head-on lihgt, or on-borad flash, however soft, simply serves to make the objects nearest the camera the brightest, and thus the most attention-grabbbing: here, the hands. But the point of your image, surely, is the clockwork - yet half of it is shadowed, it forms barely 10% of the image, there''s no sense of texture to it, it''s hard to focus on without the eye being drawn to the left-most hand (no co-incidence that that''s the brightest thing in frame). MMy attention is pulled between the hand that''s in focus on the right, and the brighter hand on the left, and it''s only by an effort of will that my eye moves to either the orange or the clockwork, and that doesn''t make for an effective image.</td>', 'The idea is neat, but your lighting is (forgive my bluntness) dreadful. Head-on lihgt, or on-borad flash, however soft, simply serves to make the objects nearest the camera the brightest, and thus the most attention-grabbbing: here, the hands. But the point of your image, surely, is the clockwork - yet half of it is shadowed, it forms barely 10% of the image, there''s no sense of texture to it, it''s hard to focus on without the eye being drawn to the left-most hand (no co-incidence that that''s the brightest thing in frame). MMy attention is pulled between the hand that''s in focus on the right, and the brighter hand on the left, and it''s only by an effort of will that my eye moves to either the orange or the clockwork, and that doesn''t make for an effective image.', '2005-01-13 20:15:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1106611, 134414, 24890, '<td valign="top">Some of the background seems a bit too bright. Otherwise nice picture and good theme. (9)<br/> <br/>ZX11??? I have a ZX6...</td>', 'Some of the background seems a bit too bright. Otherwise nice picture and good theme. (9) ZX11??? I have a ZX6...', '2005-01-13 20:17:06.000000', NULL, 1),
