(1107059, 134399, 21714, '<td valign="top">Nice idea captured well. This image can definitely be improved my getting rid of the blue caste and adjusting curves/levels.  The information is there is there in it to make a very striking image, but it''s just not been processed well.  I am assuming that for some reason you missed the caste and couldn''t do much with contrast. But if you need help with what I am talking about, you can drop me a PM and I will show you.</td>', 'Nice idea captured well. This image can definitely be improved my getting rid of the blue caste and adjusting curves/levels.  The information is there is there in it to make a very striking image, but it''s just not been processed well.  I am assuming that for some reason you missed the caste and couldn''t do much with contrast. But if you need help with what I am talking about, you can drop me a PM and I will show you.', '2005-01-14 04:21:59.000000', NULL, 1),
