(1108234, 135571, 26313, '<td valign="top">Great sky, but the flash in the foreground really takes away from it. If the subject is meant to be the field, as the title suggests, you''d probably be better off with a little longer exposure and no flash.</td>', 'Great sky, but the flash in the foreground really takes away from it. If the subject is meant to be the field, as the title suggests, you''d probably be better off with a little longer exposure and no flash.', '2005-01-14 21:21:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1108235, 133863, 6600, '<td valign="top">Super color, texture, tones,... and model.  I like the transition from light (in upper left) to dark (in the lower right).  The title certainly applies ''literally''....  Great job!</td>', 'Super color, texture, tones,... and model.  I like the transition from light (in upper left) to dark (in the lower right).  The title certainly applies ''literally''....  Great job!', '2005-01-14 21:21:51.000000', NULL, 1),
