(1108383, 135590, 17507, '<td valign="top">I think you need color for this to work... presumably the dark stuff is blood, but blood is red! This dark stuff could be anything. lacks the visceral impact it needs.</td>', 'I think you need color for this to work... presumably the dark stuff is blood, but blood is red! This dark stuff could be anything. lacks the visceral impact it needs.', '2005-01-14 23:15:04.000000', NULL, 1),
