(1109027, 134972, 3697, '<td valign="top">I really like the way you have the chess pieces set up in this shot, it really gives the feeling that the "clear" King was overwhelmed by his enemies. Nice work.</td>', 'I really like the way you have the chess pieces set up in this shot, it really gives the feeling that the "clear" King was overwhelmed by his enemies. Nice work.', '2005-01-15 13:30:39.000000', NULL, 1),
