(1109061, 135006, 25218, '<td valign="top">black &amp; white was a great choice - the horizon seems tilted, which is a bit bothersome, but otherwise it''s a beautiful picture.</td>', 'black & white was a great choice - the horizon seems tilted, which is a bit bothersome, but otherwise it''s a beautiful picture.', '2005-01-15 14:16:24.000000', NULL, 1),
