(1109071, 135136, 25218, '<td valign="top">A very clever idea - never saw the movie, but it''s about an imaginary rabbit, right? Unfortunately, I think the fuzzy edges of the shadow makes it seem like the rabbit is sitting way closer to the camera than the human, which I guess you had to, in order to make cast such a large shadow? I''ll stop rambling now. To recap: Great idea, nice execution, just a minor quibble.</td>', 'A very clever idea - never saw the movie, but it''s about an imaginary rabbit, right? Unfortunately, I think the fuzzy edges of the shadow makes it seem like the rabbit is sitting way closer to the camera than the human, which I guess you had to, in order to make cast such a large shadow? I''ll stop rambling now. To recap: Great idea, nice execution, just a minor quibble.', '2005-01-15 14:26:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1109088, 134615, 30818, '<td valign="top">I thought about doing this myself, but it was pouring rain all week and I couldn''t get outside to do it!  I think yours may have come out better anyway :)</td>', 'I thought about doing this myself, but it was pouring rain all week and I couldn''t get outside to do it!  I think yours may have come out better anyway :)', '2005-01-15 14:44:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1109092, 135003, 30818, '<td valign="top">It''s actually a moth, but I''ll give you the benifit of the doubt :)</td>', 'It''s actually a moth, but I''ll give you the benifit of the doubt :)', '2005-01-15 14:45:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1109093, 134830, 26653, '<td valign="top">Actually, is more the roof of the mouth than the throat.  focus is sharp in the bg over the shoulder, but is not sharp on the subject.<br/></td>', 'Actually, is more the roof of the mouth than the throat.  focus is sharp in the bg over the shoulder, but is not sharp on the subject.', '2005-01-15 14:46:41.000000', NULL, 1),
