(1109118, 135393, 26653, '<td valign="top">kind of a strange pose, especially with the dog''s tail under her butt.  And the focus is a liitle too soft for my taste.  I would experiment with some cropping to fill more of the frame with the subjuct and to eliminate some of the fg, or bg, or both.</td>', 'kind of a strange pose, especially with the dog''s tail under her butt.  And the focus is a liitle too soft for my taste.  I would experiment with some cropping to fill more of the frame with the subjuct and to eliminate some of the fg, or bg, or both.', '2005-01-15 15:02:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1109123, 135184, 26653, '<td valign="top">a nice sharp colorful shot.  I think it would improve with a change in the angle.  Moving more to the front of the runner to get that speaker off the top of his head, and maybe shooting from a lower perspective.<br/>Good job spotlighting the nice muscle definition.</td>', 'a nice sharp colorful shot.  I think it would improve with a change in the angle.  Moving more to the front of the runner to get that speaker off the top of his head, and maybe shooting from a lower perspective.Good job spotlighting the nice muscle definition.', '2005-01-15 15:04:51.000000', NULL, 1),
