(1109168, 134765, 26653, '<td valign="top">Pretty quiet for a Friday night!</td>', 'Pretty quiet for a Friday night!', '2005-01-15 15:36:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1109170, 133976, 29739, '<td valign="top">I''d like her face totally black and her eye closed to give the impression of no face, and the mask''s eye also black. there are some paint on her arm and the mask''s chin. I''d like her left arm lighter although I really love the shadows on her hand an on the mask. Great photo. Well framed.</td>', 'I''d like her face totally black and her eye closed to give the impression of no face, and the mask''s eye also black. there are some paint on her arm and the mask''s chin. I''d like her left arm lighter although I really love the shadows on her hand an on the mask. Great photo. Well framed.', '2005-01-15 15:36:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1109173, 135342, 26653, '<td valign="top">Looks like there is some pretty and interesting detail on that handle - too bad it''s not in focus.</td>', 'Looks like there is some pretty and interesting detail on that handle - too bad it''s not in focus.', '2005-01-15 15:37:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1109176, 134045, 26653, '<td valign="top">could have made a little more use of the mirror.</td>', 'could have made a little more use of the mirror.', '2005-01-15 15:40:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1109181, 134615, 25218, '<td valign="top">Great idea, but it lacks the "Wow" factor - the flat sky doesn''t do much for the colors of the umbrella, and the little bit of bramble in the corner is more bothersome than helpful. You definitely need something there to emphasize the lift of the umbrella from the ground, but that isn''t doing it. I really like the idea, though, so I''m giving a 6.</td>', 'Great idea, but it lacks the "Wow" factor - the flat sky doesn''t do much for the colors of the umbrella, and the little bit of bramble in the corner is more bothersome than helpful. You definitely need something there to emphasize the lift of the umbrella from the ground, but that isn''t doing it. I really like the idea, though, so I''m giving a 6.', '2005-01-15 15:47:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1109184, 135424, 26653, '<td valign="top">I see the bright light...</td>', 'I see the bright light...', '2005-01-15 15:52:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1109185, 134627, 25218, '<td valign="top">My first thought was that it doesn''t really relate to the title, but I guess you''re referring to the delicacy of the wings - it''s a stretch, but I''ll go with it : ) Techically, it seems a little out of focus. Great colors, though!</td>', 'My first thought was that it doesn''t really relate to the title, but I guess you''re referring to the delicacy of the wings - it''s a stretch, but I''ll go with it : ) Techically, it seems a little out of focus. Great colors, though!', '2005-01-15 15:52:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1109200, 134652, 26653, '<td valign="top">kinda jarring</td>', 'kinda jarring', '2005-01-15 16:08:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1109205, 134198, 25218, '<td valign="top">I like this shot -- the deep contrast &amp; over-saturation are appealing, and the composition is great - but it looks just like the hardback cover photo of the book, "You Are Not A Stranger Here", which makes me torn about my vote: you are very clever in tying the sprial to the movie, but I feel the image itself is not "original." But should "originality" be a factor of my vote? And for all I know, you were the photographer of the photo on the book, so my vote is a 9.</td>', 'I like this shot -- the deep contrast & over-saturation are appealing, and the composition is great - but it looks just like the hardback cover photo of the book, "You Are Not A Stranger Here", which makes me torn about my vote: you are very clever in tying the sprial to the movie, but I feel the image itself is not "original." But should "originality" be a factor of my vote? And for all I know, you were the photographer of the photo on the book, so my vote is a 9.', '2005-01-15 16:14:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1109210, 134778, 25218, '<td valign="top">This is a very sweet image - I love the expression on the children''s faces. The movie you tie it to is pretty obscure (I had to google search for it). I would have gone with "I Never Promised You A Rose Garden", maybe.</td>', 'This is a very sweet image - I love the expression on the children''s faces. The movie you tie it to is pretty obscure (I had to google search for it). I would have gone with "I Never Promised You A Rose Garden", maybe.', '2005-01-15 16:18:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1109212, 135528, 25218, '<td valign="top">I don''t quite get it, but it looks pretty cool. Whatever technique you employed here should do killer in the Breaking New Ground challenge!</td>', 'I don''t quite get it, but it looks pretty cool. Whatever technique you employed here should do killer in the Breaking New Ground challenge!', '2005-01-15 16:20:18.000000', NULL, 1),
