(1109943, 134399, 10658, '<td valign="top">Brilliant idea, I''ve never seen anything like this before, it''d be perfect for an ad campaign to compel people to stop smoking.  Haunting image.  Gotta give you a 10 for this!</td>', 'Brilliant idea, I''ve never seen anything like this before, it''d be perfect for an ad campaign to compel people to stop smoking.  Haunting image.  Gotta give you a 10 for this!', '2005-01-16 00:30:32.000000', NULL, 1),
