(1111583, 135257, 31133, '<td valign="top">What an adorable face! I see a little graininess, and too bad you couldn''t move the window for this shot (heh, heh, that would be advanced ediing or home remodelling), because it would be great to have more attention on the baby''s funny hairdo.</td>', 'What an adorable face! I see a little graininess, and too bad you couldn''t move the window for this shot (heh, heh, that would be advanced ediing or home remodelling), because it would be great to have more attention on the baby''s funny hairdo.', '2005-01-16 13:17:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1111594, 135260, 31133, '<td valign="top">Nice portrait. The person doesn''t exactly look scary (but I haven''t seen the movie, either). I''d like to see his chin. The light is really nicely done.</td>', 'Nice portrait. The person doesn''t exactly look scary (but I haven''t seen the movie, either). I''d like to see his chin. The light is really nicely done.', '2005-01-16 13:20:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1111607, 135489, 31834, '<td valign="top">Beautiful...I love fresh, clean, untouched snow and how well if photographs.</td>', 'Beautiful...I love fresh, clean, untouched snow and how well if photographs.', '2005-01-16 13:25:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1111610, 135322, 31834, '<td valign="top">Awesome</td>', 'Awesome', '2005-01-16 13:26:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1111612, 134530, 31133, '<td valign="top">I really like this picture (sharpness, untouched snow, colors, perspective, crop). Wish the frame weren''t so big, though.</td>', 'I really like this picture (sharpness, untouched snow, colors, perspective, crop). Wish the frame weren''t so big, though.', '2005-01-16 13:27:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1111616, 135265, 31133, '<td valign="top">Even though the blood is a natural side-effect, I think the picture would''ve been better off without it. Nice and sharp photo, with good color.</td>', 'Even though the blood is a natural side-effect, I think the picture would''ve been better off without it. Nice and sharp photo, with good color.', '2005-01-16 13:28:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1111618, 135463, 31834, '<td valign="top">Great color and lighting, but no center of visual impact. Tighter cropping, less head room would draw in the viewer to the subject.</td>', 'Great color and lighting, but no center of visual impact. Tighter cropping, less head room would draw in the viewer to the subject.', '2005-01-16 13:30:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1111625, 134371, 31133, '<td valign="top">This is the best yet! Very funny. I''m making this a favorite - so creative.</td>', 'This is the best yet! Very funny. I''m making this a favorite - so creative.', '2005-01-16 13:35:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1111628, 135555, 6667, '<td valign="top">I am going to guess thaat this is the return of Graphicfunk with a variation on a theme. . . and another ribbon!!!  If not, immatation is the best form of flattery.  BOL 7</td>', 'I am going to guess thaat this is the return of Graphicfunk with a variation on a theme. . . and another ribbon!!!  If not, immatation is the best form of flattery.  BOL 7', '2005-01-16 13:36:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1111631, 134591, 31834, '<td valign="top">The viewer''s eye is really drawn to the flower and it''s details because of the contrasting black backdrop. The water on the petals sets this photo apart from any other flower photo. Gives it that extra something that makes the viewer study the photo with great interest.</td>', 'The viewer''s eye is really drawn to the flower and it''s details because of the contrasting black backdrop. The water on the petals sets this photo apart from any other flower photo. Gives it that extra something that makes the viewer study the photo with great interest.', '2005-01-16 13:37:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1111651, 135562, 31834, '<td valign="top">The lighting and contrasting background really help the subject jump out at the viewer. Lighting shows every detail of the statue/sculpture.</td>', 'The lighting and contrasting background really help the subject jump out at the viewer. Lighting shows every detail of the statue/sculpture.', '2005-01-16 13:44:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1111657, 133973, 31834, '<td valign="top">Awesome colors.</td>', 'Awesome colors.', '2005-01-16 13:44:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1111661, 134541, 31834, '<td valign="top">This photo made me smile and I think the title is great. Perfect use of distorting the background. The viewer''s eye is drawn straight to the eye of the duck in the foreground. Great photo. Could probably be used for an add.</td>', 'This photo made me smile and I think the title is great. Perfect use of distorting the background. The viewer''s eye is drawn straight to the eye of the duck in the foreground. Great photo. Could probably be used for an add.', '2005-01-16 13:46:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1111671, 134634, 31834, '<td valign="top">Should be cropped tighter around subject of photo. The light coming from the blinds in the upper left-hand corner serves as a distraction.</td>', 'Should be cropped tighter around subject of photo. The light coming from the blinds in the upper left-hand corner serves as a distraction.', '2005-01-16 13:49:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1111674, 135327, 27304, '<td valign="top">if the</td>', 'if the', '2005-01-16 13:50:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1111675, 134692, 31834, '<td valign="top">Cute. However, a little too much head room. People in background distract the eye. Might want to crop them out.</td>', 'Cute. However, a little too much head room. People in background distract the eye. Might want to crop them out.', '2005-01-16 13:51:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1111679, 133757, 6667, '<td valign="top">Very clever!! BOL 8</td>', 'Very clever!! BOL 8', '2005-01-16 13:53:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1111689, 135197, 31834, '<td valign="top">Finally...a title that matches the photo. Looking at this photo, I would have thought of the same movie. This is the sort of photo that makes a person study every aspect and develop their own story behind it. The color gives the scene a somewhat depressing agent, but the bright building through the window adds a little bit of symbolism. Great job!</td>', 'Finally...a title that matches the photo. Looking at this photo, I would have thought of the same movie. This is the sort of photo that makes a person study every aspect and develop their own story behind it. The color gives the scene a somewhat depressing agent, but the bright building through the window adds a little bit of symbolism. Great job!', '2005-01-16 13:57:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1111691, 135195, 31834, '<td valign="top">Seems like you tried too hard to match a photo to a movie title...rather than matching a movie title to a photo.</td>', 'Seems like you tried too hard to match a photo to a movie title...rather than matching a movie title to a photo.', '2005-01-16 13:58:40.000000', NULL, 1),
