(1111911, 135585, 23141, '<td valign="top">Great lighting, nice tones.  I love the way you''ve managed to capture the texture of the coffee beans.  I don''t know about the unequal cropping of the hands, but maybe it looks better this way anyhow.</td>', 'Great lighting, nice tones.  I love the way you''ve managed to capture the texture of the coffee beans.  I don''t know about the unequal cropping of the hands, but maybe it looks better this way anyhow.', '2005-01-16 15:30:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1111915, 134972, 23141, '<td valign="top">Looks very much like a computer-generated piece of art, except for the fallen piece.  I like how you''ve managed to make that one piece look as though it was shot in a different light.  The foremost piece looks a bit out of focus, and I don''t like the uneven border.</td>', 'Looks very much like a computer-generated piece of art, except for the fallen piece.  I like how you''ve managed to make that one piece look as though it was shot in a different light.  The foremost piece looks a bit out of focus, and I don''t like the uneven border.', '2005-01-16 15:33:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1111919, 135445, 23141, '<td valign="top">Fits the title and very colorful.  However, lighting is a little boring (straight on) and drops are not in focus.  Could be more artistically shown.</td>', 'Fits the title and very colorful.  However, lighting is a little boring (straight on) and drops are not in focus.  Could be more artistically shown.', '2005-01-16 15:34:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1111922, 135077, 23141, '<td valign="top">I like hi-key, but your trees here seem to be out of focus throughout the scene.  Composition works well, but there''s nothing here to keep my attention.</td>', 'I like hi-key, but your trees here seem to be out of focus throughout the scene.  Composition works well, but there''s nothing here to keep my attention.', '2005-01-16 15:36:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1111932, 134591, 23141, '<td valign="top">I like this a lot - am really enjoying taking in the details.  I only have two suggestions: maybe try moving the center of the daisy a little further left, leaving an interesting negative space to the right.  Although you may have tried that and found that you like this composition better.  And it looks as though the petals nearest the light are a bit overexposed.</td>', 'I like this a lot - am really enjoying taking in the details.  I only have two suggestions: maybe try moving the center of the daisy a little further left, leaving an interesting negative space to the right.  Although you may have tried that and found that you like this composition better.  And it looks as though the petals nearest the light are a bit overexposed.', '2005-01-16 15:39:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1111939, 135197, 23141, '<td valign="top">Very interesting picture that works well with your title.  Not a big fan of the orange cast.  Also, might have tried different angles for a more dynamic composition.</td>', 'Very interesting picture that works well with your title.  Not a big fan of the orange cast.  Also, might have tried different angles for a more dynamic composition.', '2005-01-16 15:41:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1111950, 133904, 23141, '<td valign="top">Picture works well with the title you''ve chosen, but the picture itself isn''t terribly interesting.  A different angle (especially without the weed in his back) might have made the picture more dynamic.  Different lighting (less light, light from a low level, spotlighting, etc.) would help add interest as well.</td>', 'Picture works well with the title you''ve chosen, but the picture itself isn''t terribly interesting.  A different angle (especially without the weed in his back) might have made the picture more dynamic.  Different lighting (less light, light from a low level, spotlighting, etc.) would help add interest as well.', '2005-01-16 15:44:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1111954, 134371, 23141, '<td valign="top">Funny!  :)  Don''t think it''ll take a ribbon, but thanks for making me smile!  And is that a Breyer mule I see in there?</td>', 'Funny!  :)  Don''t think it''ll take a ribbon, but thanks for making me smile!  And is that a Breyer mule I see in there?', '2005-01-16 15:46:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1111955, 134335, 23141, '<td valign="top">Gah!  Another woody!  But, this is funny and you''ve got a good mood here with the lighting.</td>', 'Gah!  Another woody!  But, this is funny and you''ve got a good mood here with the lighting.', '2005-01-16 15:46:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1111963, 135465, 23141, '<td valign="top">Train of thought:  Picture works well with the title, but lighting is harsh and flat.  Cropping and composition are a little off as well - if I apply the rule of thirds, I see that the hand appears to be your main subject.  But the hand is out of focus, which leaves me searching for the focal point (the lips?) by following the line of the hand and lipstick tube.  However, the lips are nearly out of the picture and have a funny little gap.  Hope this helps :)</td>', 'Train of thought:  Picture works well with the title, but lighting is harsh and flat.  Cropping and composition are a little off as well - if I apply the rule of thirds, I see that the hand appears to be your main subject.  But the hand is out of focus, which leaves me searching for the focal point (the lips?) by following the line of the hand and lipstick tube.  However, the lips are nearly out of the picture and have a funny little gap.  Hope this helps :)', '2005-01-16 15:51:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1111964, 134207, 23141, '<td valign="top">Good choice of title, but lighting and composition in the picture leave me uninspired.</td>', 'Good choice of title, but lighting and composition in the picture leave me uninspired.', '2005-01-16 15:52:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1111969, 135531, 23141, '<td valign="top">I do like how her dress trails away to make her seem like a genie.  Her face does appear to be a bit overexposed.</td>', 'I do like how her dress trails away to make her seem like a genie.  Her face does appear to be a bit overexposed.', '2005-01-16 15:53:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1111987, 134652, 23141, '<td valign="top">Too funny!  I like the mystical background and would have liked to have seen just the foremost tree against that fogginess, but I did get a laugh out of your Mexican.  Oh, and BTW, your power lines are showing :)</td>', 'Too funny!  I like the mystical background and would have liked to have seen just the foremost tree against that fogginess, but I did get a laugh out of your Mexican.  Oh, and BTW, your power lines are showing :)', '2005-01-16 15:57:15.000000', NULL, 1),
