(1113120, 134992, 26151, '<td valign="top">"Wun you wascal wabbit, wun!!"  "It just doesn''t matter, it just doesn''t matter . . ." "Spaz, you''re on your way." One of my favorite movies. Haven''t seen it in years, but I still know all the quotes. Good idea for the photo, but it seems to be out of focus or something. It kind of looks like a picture of a picture. Weird. But I like the movie.</td>', '"Wun you wascal wabbit, wun!!"  "It just doesn''t matter, it just doesn''t matter . . ." "Spaz, you''re on your way." One of my favorite movies. Haven''t seen it in years, but I still know all the quotes. Good idea for the photo, but it seems to be out of focus or something. It kind of looks like a picture of a picture. Weird. But I like the movie.', '2005-01-16 23:24:56.000000', NULL, 1),
