(1113221, 133788, 31720, '<td valign="top">I think taking this shot in the middle of the night with a flash would greatly improve this image, as it would eliminate the parking lot background and replace it with a stark black (if there aren''t any streetlights near).  As it is, the picture is unfocused (not out of focus) with the bright background.</td>', 'I think taking this shot in the middle of the night with a flash would greatly improve this image, as it would eliminate the parking lot background and replace it with a stark black (if there aren''t any streetlights near).  As it is, the picture is unfocused (not out of focus) with the bright background.', '2005-01-17 00:05:28.000000', NULL, 1),
