(1113334, 135391, 31595, '<td valign="top">Excellent photo! 10</td>', 'Excellent photo! 10', '2005-01-17 00:43:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1113337, 135447, 31720, '<td valign="top">Brighter colors in the roses would have earned a 9.  For now, 8.</td>', 'Brighter colors in the roses would have earned a 9.  For now, 8.', '2005-01-17 00:45:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1113344, 135032, 31720, '<td valign="top">The title would have made more sense if there was only one bridge in the picture.  Otherwise, good picture.</td>', 'The title would have made more sense if there was only one bridge in the picture.  Otherwise, good picture.', '2005-01-17 00:48:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1113349, 133707, 31720, '<td valign="top">The motion blur really takes away from the effectiveness of this shot, both muffling the actual splash and making the cause of those splashes indiscernable, thus unintersting.  Where is this?  Underground?</td>', 'The motion blur really takes away from the effectiveness of this shot, both muffling the actual splash and making the cause of those splashes indiscernable, thus unintersting.  Where is this?  Underground?', '2005-01-17 00:51:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1113483, 133863, 4267, '<td valign="top">Spank!</td>', 'Spank!', '2005-01-17 02:03:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1113603, 135573, 22970, '<td valign="top">Nice photograph. The black background almost make it look like the seeds are falling with them being slightly out of focus. Wish the inside of the pepper would of had more detail. But sill a good shot. Best of luck, wish you well in the challenge.</td>', 'Nice photograph. The black background almost make it look like the seeds are falling with them being slightly out of focus. Wish the inside of the pepper would of had more detail. But sill a good shot. Best of luck, wish you well in the challenge.', '2005-01-17 03:14:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1113607, 135501, 22970, '<td valign="top">Nice shot - I like the corona look at the top with the light shinning outward. Good focus. Not to much punch but still a good shot. Wish you the best in the challenge.</td>', 'Nice shot - I like the corona look at the top with the light shinning outward. Good focus. Not to much punch but still a good shot. Wish you the best in the challenge.', '2005-01-17 03:16:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1113609, 134942, 22970, '<td valign="top">Very nice focus, color and lighting. Great job</td>', 'Very nice focus, color and lighting. Great job', '2005-01-17 03:17:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1113611, 135593, 22970, '<td valign="top">Kind of flat but there are a lot of birds there.</td>', 'Kind of flat but there are a lot of birds there.', '2005-01-17 03:18:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1113613, 134975, 22970, '<td valign="top">Don''t know the movie but nice action capture.</td>', 'Don''t know the movie but nice action capture.', '2005-01-17 03:18:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1113614, 134198, 22970, '<td valign="top">The details don''t seem to be crisp and out of focus. Nice curves but border distracting.</td>', 'The details don''t seem to be crisp and out of focus. Nice curves but border distracting.', '2005-01-17 03:20:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1113619, 134394, 22970, '<td valign="top">Good picture but the table is distracting. I don''t know the movie but that''s OK. I wish you would of cropped right above the table top leaving the reflections. I copied and pasted in PS and done the crop and it looked great. Anyway still a good picture. 7 [cropped off table would of been 8 or 9]</td>', 'Good picture but the table is distracting. I don''t know the movie but that''s OK. I wish you would of cropped right above the table top leaving the reflections. I copied and pasted in PS and done the crop and it looked great. Anyway still a good picture. 7 [cropped off table would of been 8 or 9]', '2005-01-17 03:24:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1113620, 135554, 22970, '<td valign="top">focus off on the main subject and soft on the flower.</td>', 'focus off on the main subject and soft on the flower.', '2005-01-17 03:25:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1113635, 135533, 23251, '<td valign="top">Very nice image, great feel to it and the tree is sharp. Well done!</td>', 'Very nice image, great feel to it and the tree is sharp. Well done!', '2005-01-17 03:38:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1113642, 135528, 23251, '<td valign="top">The movement of the lens spoils the photo IMHO.  Maybe that is what you tried to get but it did not work for me.  I like the way you have tried a different approach to the challenge.  Cood luck.</td>', 'The movement of the lens spoils the photo IMHO.  Maybe that is what you tried to get but it did not work for me.  I like the way you have tried a different approach to the challenge.  Cood luck.', '2005-01-17 03:41:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1113646, 134182, 23251, '<td valign="top">The OOF and the fact that it is only an American sport so few will relate to it will hurt your score I think.  Good angle though.</td>', 'The OOF and the fact that it is only an American sport so few will relate to it will hurt your score I think.  Good angle though.', '2005-01-17 03:43:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1113651, 134151, 23251, '<td valign="top">What a great capture!  Nice and sharp on the eyes.  Well done!</td>', 'What a great capture!  Nice and sharp on the eyes.  Well done!', '2005-01-17 03:45:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1113655, 135338, 23251, '<td valign="top">Although this is well done I think it will suffer as toys don''t seem to do so well here.  The exposure is good on the toy.  Maybe if it was zoomed out a little it would help?</td>', 'Although this is well done I think it will suffer as toys don''t seem to do so well here.  The exposure is good on the toy.  Maybe if it was zoomed out a little it would help?', '2005-01-17 03:49:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1113676, 135432, 6388, '<td valign="top">Wow.  Speechless.  This would make Audrey herself blush at it''s perfection.  Pose, frame, crop, lighting,everything.  perfect.  If this doesn''t get a ribbon Imma lose it.<br/> <br/> <br/>i wanted to spell it <i>speachless</i>, just because i think i''m funny, and you''d get it ;)</td>', 'Wow.  Speechless.  This would make Audrey herself blush at it''s perfection.  Pose, frame, crop, lighting,everything.  perfect.  If this doesn''t get a ribbon Imma lose it.  i wanted to spell it speachless, just because i think i''m funny, and you''d get it ;)', '2005-01-17 04:18:02.000000', NULL, 1),
