(1114306, 133865, 6667, '<td valign="top">I hope this does well.  You deserve it for the play on words and nailing the theme!  I just wonder how many will grasp the signifigance of the chain link and your titile.  Slightly out of focus.  BOL 6</td>', 'I hope this does well.  You deserve it for the play on words and nailing the theme!  I just wonder how many will grasp the signifigance of the chain link and your titile.  Slightly out of focus.  BOL 6', '2005-01-17 11:35:19.000000', NULL, 1),
