(1114341, 134975, 6667, '<td valign="top">Finally!  Someone who has the correct scene with the correct topic of this movie.  (It was not about football as some have depicted!)  Nice capture and BOL 7 here</td>', 'Finally!  Someone who has the correct scene with the correct topic of this movie.  (It was not about football as some have depicted!)  Nice capture and BOL 7 here', '2005-01-17 11:47:56.000000', NULL, 1),
