(1114417, 134335, 30490, '<td valign="top">I really don''t like images with the wooden people.  The knife is out of proportion to the "person".  I do like the lighting from behind the shower and the water dropplets.</td>', 'I really don''t like images with the wooden people.  The knife is out of proportion to the "person".  I do like the lighting from behind the shower and the water dropplets.', '2005-01-17 12:19:36.000000', NULL, 1),
