(1114715, 135232, 8860, '<td valign="top">Lovely shot - perfect title. Those birds are icing on a stormy cake. Great light and a superb perspective on the structure. My only criticism is a lack of breathing space at the top, so I''d have let more sky in - even if it wasn''t very stormy looking.</td>', 'Lovely shot - perfect title. Those birds are icing on a stormy cake. Great light and a superb perspective on the structure. My only criticism is a lack of breathing space at the top, so I''d have let more sky in - even if it wasn''t very stormy looking.', '2005-01-17 14:04:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1114723, 134201, 30584, '<td valign="top">I love this..so appealing, could look at it for hours</td>', 'I love this..so appealing, could look at it for hours', '2005-01-17 14:08:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1114724, 135136, 7252, '<td valign="top">At first I thought the image was relatively well done but it didn''t hold any real interest for me. Over the week though this has grown on me. While the photo doesn''t have to relate to the movie, only the title. I think you''ve done a good job relating to both.</td>', 'At first I thought the image was relatively well done but it didn''t hold any real interest for me. Over the week though this has grown on me. While the photo doesn''t have to relate to the movie, only the title. I think you''ve done a good job relating to both.', '2005-01-17 14:09:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1114748, 135014, 16046, '<td valign="top">Very cool</td>', 'Very cool', '2005-01-17 14:20:52.000000', NULL, 1),
