(1115005, 133581, 30818, '<td valign="top">Good idea, but the shot could''ve been better!  The dreamcatcher is hard to see</td>', 'Good idea, but the shot could''ve been better!  The dreamcatcher is hard to see', '2005-01-17 16:03:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1115021, 134371, 4090, '<td valign="top">Very Funny !</td>', 'Very Funny !', '2005-01-17 16:09:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1115034, 134948, 27845, '<td valign="top">Interesting use of contrast and noise. Is that a real woman? It''s hard to tell beacuse od the (cool) destructive look. 8.</td>', 'Interesting use of contrast and noise. Is that a real woman? It''s hard to tell beacuse od the (cool) destructive look. 8.', '2005-01-17 16:14:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1115036, 135576, 8860, '<td valign="top">This is all a bit too literal really - a pic of a casino, called ''Casino''! The challenge states "be creative" and I really feel that this is a snapshot with a title that fits the brief.<br/> <br/>Critically, the subject isn''t framed well and the exposure is poor, resulting in harsh, dense contrast. Sorry to be negative here but this is what voters are thinking and if you care about the challenges then you can sort it next time!  : )</td>', 'This is all a bit too literal really - a pic of a casino, called ''Casino''! The challenge states "be creative" and I really feel that this is a snapshot with a title that fits the brief. Critically, the subject isn''t framed well and the exposure is poor, resulting in harsh, dense contrast. Sorry to be negative here but this is what voters are thinking and if you care about the challenges then you can sort it next time!  : )', '2005-01-17 16:15:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1115038, 135263, 27845, '<td valign="top">''The Beach'' (with DiCaprio) would have been more fitting, as there is only one. This would have done better as b/w, as the colours aren''t very interesting. Also, the foggy upper part doesn''t add to the image, you could have cropped it. 3.</td>', '''The Beach'' (with DiCaprio) would have been more fitting, as there is only one. This would have done better as b/w, as the colours aren''t very interesting. Also, the foggy upper part doesn''t add to the image, you could have cropped it. 3.', '2005-01-17 16:16:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1115046, 134973, 27845, '<td valign="top">Looks strange. Very interesting perspective and a cool place (I hope that''s no flood!). I may be wrong, but it looks to me as if you had made excessive use of NeatImage (mainly in the tree tops). I''d have liked to see some noise in here! 8.</td>', 'Looks strange. Very interesting perspective and a cool place (I hope that''s no flood!). I may be wrong, but it looks to me as if you had made excessive use of NeatImage (mainly in the tree tops). I''d have liked to see some noise in here! 8.', '2005-01-17 16:18:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1115047, 135079, 27845, '<td valign="top">Putting the light a little more frontal would have shown some more details. Also, the negative space doesn''t seem to do any good here. 4.</td>', 'Putting the light a little more frontal would have shown some more details. Also, the negative space doesn''t seem to do any good here. 4.', '2005-01-17 16:19:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1115050, 135501, 27845, '<td valign="top">I''d have cropped it about 25px tighter on each side. It looks a bit unsharp but I guess that''s because of the bubbles. The composition isn''t very interesting. Maybe you should have shown only a quarter of the sphere. 5.</td>', 'I''d have cropped it about 25px tighter on each side. It looks a bit unsharp but I guess that''s because of the bubbles. The composition isn''t very interesting. Maybe you should have shown only a quarter of the sphere. 5.', '2005-01-17 16:20:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1115052, 135032, 27845, '<td valign="top">Cool perspective, almost perfect vanishing point. I''d have preferred a b/w for this shot. It would have epmhasized the structure of the bridge and it''s leading lines. 7.</td>', 'Cool perspective, almost perfect vanishing point. I''d have preferred a b/w for this shot. It would have epmhasized the structure of the bridge and it''s leading lines. 7.', '2005-01-17 16:21:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1115056, 135226, 8860, '<td valign="top">An unusually effective use of negative - which I didn''t immediately take in. Good textures and an aesthetic composition with a creative appraoch to the brief. The only flaw is the too-strong ''shadow'' (highlight) which has blown under the leaves.</td>', 'An unusually effective use of negative - which I didn''t immediately take in. Good textures and an aesthetic composition with a creative appraoch to the brief. The only flaw is the too-strong ''shadow'' (highlight) which has blown under the leaves.', '2005-01-17 16:22:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1115059, 134178, 8860, '<td valign="top">Nice moody shot, well composed.</td>', 'Nice moody shot, well composed.', '2005-01-17 16:24:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1115064, 134975, 27845, '<td valign="top">Isn''t it called ''On any given sunday?'' Maybe both exist. I guess your hinting at the motorcross being every week on Sunday? Maybe you could have found a more fitting title, but that doesn''t matter so much. I like the motion blur on the people in the background, but I think they are not blurry enough. The spectators are quite distracting from the main interest, the biker. Have a look at these:<br/>//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=34000<br/>//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=5817<br/>Maybe a tighter crop would have been another way to guide the eye to the biker. 5.</td>', 'Isn''t it called ''On any given sunday?'' Maybe both exist. I guess your hinting at the motorcross being every week on Sunday? Maybe you could have found a more fitting title, but that doesn''t matter so much. I like the motion blur on the people in the background, but I think they are not blurry enough. The spectators are quite distracting from the main interest, the biker. Have a look at these://www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=34000//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=5817Maybe a tighter crop would have been another way to guide the eye to the biker. 5.', '2005-01-17 16:26:34.000000', NULL, 1),
