(1115822, 135465, 10658, '<td valign="top">This would be better if the size was larger and if the flash didn''t reflect off the lipstick so harshly.  Great idea for the challenge though :)</td>', 'This would be better if the size was larger and if the flash didn''t reflect off the lipstick so harshly.  Great idea for the challenge though :)', '2005-01-18 00:23:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1115826, 134530, 10658, '<td valign="top">I really like how the snow is still on the trees rather than having been blown off by the wind.  As far as scenes with snow go this type is my favorite.  So serene, peaceful.  I love your composition as well, the fence is gorgeous and rustic and leads the eye directly to the path through the trees.  This is the first 10 I''m giving for this challenge :)</td>', 'I really like how the snow is still on the trees rather than having been blown off by the wind.  As far as scenes with snow go this type is my favorite.  So serene, peaceful.  I love your composition as well, the fence is gorgeous and rustic and leads the eye directly to the path through the trees.  This is the first 10 I''m giving for this challenge :)', '2005-01-18 00:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1115828, 135342, 10658, '<td valign="top">This is a bit too bright for my tastes, seems very overexposed.  I can''t tell where the focus is because it seems as if the whole photo is blurred.  The idea, however, fits the challenge so I''m giving you a 4.</td>', 'This is a bit too bright for my tastes, seems very overexposed.  I can''t tell where the focus is because it seems as if the whole photo is blurred.  The idea, however, fits the challenge so I''m giving you a 4.', '2005-01-18 00:33:10.000000', NULL, 1),
