(1116885, 135489, 22489, '<td valign="top">Again,it looks like a creek to me.The front part is appealing and nicely done considering the light but theflare and trees are confusing and distracting.</td>', 'Again,it looks like a creek to me.The front part is appealing and nicely done considering the light but theflare and trees are confusing and distracting.', '2005-01-18 13:46:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1116889, 134444, 22489, '<td valign="top">Iknowthe movie well but don''t get the picture and it is not visually appealing</td>', 'Iknowthe movie well but don''t get the picture and it is not visually appealing', '2005-01-18 13:47:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1116891, 135429, 22489, '<td valign="top">An interesting photo with neat tone but not much sense of the connotation of the "Paparazzi."</td>', 'An interesting photo with neat tone but not much sense of the connotation of the "Paparazzi."', '2005-01-18 13:48:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1116894, 135079, 22489, '<td valign="top">Very expressive use of black and white and lighting. I don''t have a strong feel for its thematic implications.</td>', 'Very expressive use of black and white and lighting. I don''t have a strong feel for its thematic implications.', '2005-01-18 13:50:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1116903, 135569, 30818, '<td valign="top">Very funny!  I had to look at it a second time to get the Mystic part of it!  I didn''t see the guy "lifting" the pizza on the bottom left!  Once I did, I appreciated it much more :)</td>', 'Very funny!  I had to look at it a second time to get the Mystic part of it!  I didn''t see the guy "lifting" the pizza on the bottom left!  Once I did, I appreciated it much more :)', '2005-01-18 13:54:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1116918, 134182, 26653, '<td valign="top">I don''t mind the tilt, but I do mind that nothing is in focus, especially when it seems they will stand there as long as you need.</td>', 'I don''t mind the tilt, but I do mind that nothing is in focus, especially when it seems they will stand there as long as you need.', '2005-01-18 14:04:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1116925, 135193, 26653, '<td valign="top">The light seems too hot on spots of the hand.  I like the que stick leading back to the face, I think it would have made for a more interesting shot to have the eye in focus, (showing intense concetration etc) instead of the hand in focus.  The hand, well, is just a hand.</td>', 'The light seems too hot on spots of the hand.  I like the que stick leading back to the face, I think it would have made for a more interesting shot to have the eye in focus, (showing intense concetration etc) instead of the hand in focus.  The hand, well, is just a hand.', '2005-01-18 14:07:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1116935, 135292, 32132, '<td valign="top">Clever, and the elevated saturation gives a nice vivid quality. I also like the composition.</td>', 'Clever, and the elevated saturation gives a nice vivid quality. I also like the composition.', '2005-01-18 14:13:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1116941, 135391, 32132, '<td valign="top">Pretty, did it take a bazillion attempts? Nice background gradient. Very professional.</td>', 'Pretty, did it take a bazillion attempts? Nice background gradient. Very professional.', '2005-01-18 14:16:45.000000', NULL, 1),
