(1117012, 135266, 29363, '<td valign="top">Too fast, too furious --- too old. A smashed up sports car would have been a better fit for this title. Not sure why it''s blurry on the back end and cut off on the front.</td>', 'Too fast, too furious --- too old. A smashed up sports car would have been a better fit for this title. Not sure why it''s blurry on the back end and cut off on the front.', '2005-01-18 14:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
