(1117133, 135177, 29363, '<td valign="top">Nice light --- would like to see from a more interesting angle --- perhaps showing something in the foreground to lead in.</td>', 'Nice light --- would like to see from a more interesting angle --- perhaps showing something in the foreground to lead in.', '2005-01-18 15:41:27.000000', NULL, 1),
