(1117609, 135462, 22479, '<td valign="top">This guy looks genuinely psycho. Excellent how you angled the lighting to place the shadow onto the subjects eyebrows, giving him that sinister look. Bravo.</td>', 'This guy looks genuinely psycho. Excellent how you angled the lighting to place the shadow onto the subjects eyebrows, giving him that sinister look. Bravo.', '2005-01-18 19:58:48.000000', NULL, 1),
