(1118733, 133991, 23394, '<td valign="top">yikes, sierra!  i don''t this deserved this low of a score (i gave it a 7).<br/> <br/>my advice to you is not to get discouraged.  take advantage of the galleries and the archives.  mine them for examples of what you would like to do, then set aside a little time each week to try to recreate the images that you admire.  you might feel that you don''t have the greatest camera in the world, but it has produced some pretty decent images for others.  just keep on shooting and sharing, and sooner or later, you''ll get to where you want to be!  good luck,<br/> <br/>skip</td>', 'yikes, sierra!  i don''t this deserved this low of a score (i gave it a 7). my advice to you is not to get discouraged.  take advantage of the galleries and the archives.  mine them for examples of what you would like to do, then set aside a little time each week to try to recreate the images that you admire.  you might feel that you don''t have the greatest camera in the world, but it has produced some pretty decent images for others.  just keep on shooting and sharing, and sooner or later, you''ll get to where you want to be!  good luck, skip', '2005-01-19 08:52:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(1118755, 135232, 6870, '<td valign="top">This is great! Good luck paying your speeding ticket!</td>', 'This is great! Good luck paying your speeding ticket!', '2005-01-19 09:15:39.000000', NULL, 0),
