(1118802, 135592, 18216, '<td valign="top">I like the out-of-focus take on this photo. I also liked that the face was hidden. It leaves more to the imagination. Even the background wall fits in this photo.</td>', 'I like the out-of-focus take on this photo. I also liked that the face was hidden. It leaves more to the imagination. Even the background wall fits in this photo.', '2005-01-19 09:53:54.000000', NULL, 0),
(1118820, 134541, 5792, '<td valign="top">Congrats on a very, very clever idea for your movie title. It fits the movie perfectly. Well deserved ribbon.</td>', 'Congrats on a very, very clever idea for your movie title. It fits the movie perfectly. Well deserved ribbon.', '2005-01-19 10:03:30.000000', NULL, 0),
(1118825, 135033, 18216, '<td valign="top">Very nice bokeh in this shot! I also like your use of thirds for the focused area.</td>', 'Very nice bokeh in this shot! I also like your use of thirds for the focused area.', '2005-01-19 10:06:40.000000', NULL, 0),
(1118830, 135232, 5792, '<td valign="top">Congrats on the blue. I like when photographers post their originals. It is more instructive than anything else and always proves that proper post processing turns an already good image into an award winner. Btw, I like the comet shots in your portfolio.</td>', 'Congrats on the blue. I like when photographers post their originals. It is more instructive than anything else and always proves that proper post processing turns an already good image into an award winner. Btw, I like the comet shots in your portfolio.', '2005-01-19 10:10:56.000000', NULL, 0),
(1118832, 134178, 5792, '<td valign="top">Another wonderful photograph from one of the all time greats at DPC. Great job.</td>', 'Another wonderful photograph from one of the all time greats at DPC. Great job.', '2005-01-19 10:13:50.000000', NULL, 0),
(1118834, 134399, 5792, '<td valign="top">This is one of my top three picks for this challenge. It is very creative and technically near perfection.</td>', 'This is one of my top three picks for this challenge. It is very creative and technically near perfection.', '2005-01-19 10:15:35.000000', NULL, 0),
(1118837, 135012, 5792, '<td valign="top">One of my top three choices for ribbons in this challenge. It is exceptionally well done. Composition, color, lighting and shadow are all excellent. Great job. A nice setup for this shot.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-01-20 10:03:45.</i></td>', 'One of my top three choices for ribbons in this challenge. It is exceptionally well done. Composition, color, lighting and shadow are all excellent. Great job. A nice setup for this shot.', '2005-01-19 10:18:14.000000', '2005-01-20 10:03:45.000000', 0),
(1118842, 135548, 5792, '<td valign="top">One of my top three choices for this challenge. Just a super image that has strong visual impact.</td>', 'One of my top three choices for this challenge. Just a super image that has strong visual impact.', '2005-01-19 10:21:04.000000', NULL, 0),
(1118843, 134178, 24925, '<td valign="top">I love everything about this photo except I''m severely bothered my the perception that this leans to the right...which it does, but just barely.<br/> <br/>With that corrected, this would have received a 10 from me also.  <br/> <br/>Now, let me gush:<br/> <br/>This is one of the creepiest photos I''ve seen, without being overbearingly obvious.  It''s what''s not there that makes it bothersome.  It''s the implications that make it moody.  As a soft portrait of a beautiful woman is much more effective to me than an erotic photo of her wearing next to nothing, so is this photo much more a display of tension and horror than any blood in the bathtub photo could ever be.<br/> <br/>Great work...you truly deserved your ribbon!</td>', 'I love everything about this photo except I''m severely bothered my the perception that this leans to the right...which it does, but just barely. With that corrected, this would have received a 10 from me also.   Now, let me gush: This is one of the creepiest photos I''ve seen, without being overbearingly obvious.  It''s what''s not there that makes it bothersome.  It''s the implications that make it moody.  As a soft portrait of a beautiful woman is much more effective to me than an erotic photo of her wearing next to nothing, so is this photo much more a display of tension and horror than any blood in the bathtub photo could ever be. Great work...you truly deserved your ribbon!', '2005-01-19 10:22:09.000000', NULL, 0),
(1118853, 135432, 6073, '<td valign="top">Wow.  This is one good looking woman.  Cheers on such a great job, and yes, you were totally robbed.</td>', 'Wow.  This is one good looking woman.  Cheers on such a great job, and yes, you were totally robbed.', '2005-01-19 10:29:16.000000', NULL, 0),
(1118863, 135550, 29797, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by erusan:</b></div><hr/><i> nice for a candid shot. regulations prohibit inserting some gaussian blurin the background in post. did you try just for fun? cool guys, nice capture </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>No gaussian blur, just a combo of falling rain and dof.</td>', 'Originally posted by erusan: nice for a candid shot. regulations prohibit inserting some gaussian blurin the background in post. did you try just for fun? cool guys, nice capture   No gaussian blur, just a combo of falling rain and dof.', '2005-01-19 10:36:34.000000', NULL, 0),
(1118869, 134665, 27574, '<td valign="top">I was one of those eight that gave this one a 10, it was one of my favorites.  You did a beautiful job and I love the look on the boys face. GREAT!</td>', 'I was one of those eight that gave this one a 10, it was one of my favorites.  You did a beautiful job and I love the look on the boys face. GREAT!', '2005-01-19 10:39:34.000000', NULL, 0),
