(1118971, 133865, 7438, '<td valign="top">I honestly expected this to do better. I mean, seven 1''s, nine 2''s and twenty three 3''s?!<br/> <br/>I really appreciate the comments though, so thank you all :)</td>', 'I honestly expected this to do better. I mean, seven 1''s, nine 2''s and twenty three 3''s?! I really appreciate the comments though, so thank you all :)', '2005-01-19 11:36:34.000000', NULL, 0),
