(1118990, 135095, 26045, '<td valign="top"><br/>Excellent, very much an era photo, looks great in sepia, love the pose...I think you did a great job on this. I was one of your 10s, and thought this would surely place higher.</td>', 'Excellent, very much an era photo, looks great in sepia, love the pose...I think you did a great job on this. I was one of your 10s, and thought this would surely place higher.', '2005-01-19 11:41:39.000000', NULL, 0),
