(1120250, 134943, 21890, '<td valign="top">I was by accident. My kid was playing with an ice ball which he made using a balloon filled with water. I didnt get much time to grab the shot before the ice melted away and I really didnt notice the bowl when i took the picture. Better luck next time :)</td>', 'I was by accident. My kid was playing with an ice ball which he made using a balloon filled with water. I didnt get much time to grab the shot before the ice melted away and I really didnt notice the bowl when i took the picture. Better luck next time :)', '2005-01-19 21:03:42.000000', NULL, 0),
(1120303, 135462, 24890, '<td valign="top">I think this is a neat idea. Especially with the movie theme. I just think the shadow from the knife, and that fact that the knife seems blurry, hurt this picture.<br/> <br/>But that is just my opinion... I am just learning about photography.</td>', 'I think this is a neat idea. Especially with the movie theme. I just think the shadow from the knife, and that fact that the knife seems blurry, hurt this picture. But that is just my opinion... I am just learning about photography.', '2005-01-19 21:22:17.000000', NULL, 0),
(1120341, 135327, 30861, '<td valign="top">The idea was that the boot would emulate a conning tower rising from the sea, that the snow would emulate the wake surging over the hull, etc. Thus the angle; it closely duplicates an angle in the movie. I had hoped the horizontal band of snow would "suggest" a stormy sky.<br/> <br/>Evidently, it didn''t work. <br/> <br/>Robt.</td>', 'The idea was that the boot would emulate a conning tower rising from the sea, that the snow would emulate the wake surging over the hull, etc. Thus the angle; it closely duplicates an angle in the movie. I had hoped the horizontal band of snow would "suggest" a stormy sky. Evidently, it didn''t work.  Robt.', '2005-01-19 21:37:10.000000', NULL, 0),
