(1120723, 135462, 31213, '<td valign="top">I gave it an 8.  This photo really hit a nerve with me.  I go by my 1st impression...and you got what you wanted with me.  I appreciate the mood of the picture...although you''re not invited over here!  Here''s a tip....focus on getting better.  Get the feedback, but know that a lot of people, or maybe just a handful (around 20), found this picture VERY good.  Your work should FIRST please you (as yours did), then it''s a pure bonus if "some" others also get rocked by it.  Keep up the good work!</td>', 'I gave it an 8.  This photo really hit a nerve with me.  I go by my 1st impression...and you got what you wanted with me.  I appreciate the mood of the picture...although you''re not invited over here!  Here''s a tip....focus on getting better.  Get the feedback, but know that a lot of people, or maybe just a handful (around 20), found this picture VERY good.  Your work should FIRST please you (as yours did), then it''s a pure bonus if "some" others also get rocked by it.  Keep up the good work!', '2005-01-20 02:29:29.000000', NULL, 0),
