(1121194, 135462, 16648, '<td valign="top">I did not vote on your image, but from looking at it now i might have given it a 4. The knife - i didn''t know what it was until i read your description. Then I knew, but still think it looks like some motion light effect or error. Overall the pic is a bit dark.</td>', 'I did not vote on your image, but from looking at it now i might have given it a 4. The knife - i didn''t know what it was until i read your description. Then I knew, but still think it looks like some motion light effect or error. Overall the pic is a bit dark.', '2005-01-20 11:00:08.000000', NULL, 0),
