(1121799, 134201, 26849, '<td valign="top">Thanks for all the support on this one. My highest score so far. 7th place. Also very encouraging to get the 2nd highest count for the most "Favorites" on this Challenge.<br/> <br/>This was not originally shot for the challenge. This scene was next to a puddle with birds that were my subjects. <br/> <br/>When reviewing and playing with the images I shot that day, I was adjusting the contrast to try to hide a dark dust spot near the edge, when I went high contrast, it really reminded me of the Apocalypse Now movie. So I spent a lot of time trying to get the best coloring I could and retain the mood of the movie.<br/> <br/>Thanks again,<br/> <br/>Rod</td>', 'Thanks for all the support on this one. My highest score so far. 7th place. Also very encouraging to get the 2nd highest count for the most "Favorites" on this Challenge. This was not originally shot for the challenge. This scene was next to a puddle with birds that were my subjects.  When reviewing and playing with the images I shot that day, I was adjusting the contrast to try to hide a dark dust spot near the edge, when I went high contrast, it really reminded me of the Apocalypse Now movie. So I spent a lot of time trying to get the best coloring I could and retain the mood of the movie. Thanks again, Rod', '2005-01-20 16:38:26.000000', NULL, 0),
(1121944, 134541, 7252, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by soup:</b></div><hr/><i> i can get you all the ducks you need, with just about any expression, actors, sports figures, musicians,  and even the run of the mill standard duck<br/> <br/>congrats </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Thank you. I did find tons of ducks online. I didn''t realize there was such a variety. I was just surprised that my first stop, Toys R Us didn''t have any. It''s like not having milk in the grocery store as far as I''m concerned.</td>', 'Originally posted by soup: i can get you all the ducks you need, with just about any expression, actors, sports figures, musicians,  and even the run of the mill standard duck congrats   Thank you. I did find tons of ducks online. I didn''t realize there was such a variety. I was just surprised that my first stop, Toys R Us didn''t have any. It''s like not having milk in the grocery store as far as I''m concerned.', '2005-01-20 18:00:09.000000', NULL, 0),
