(1124144, 134178, 4493, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Available Light:</b></div><hr/><i> Hey great shot. Why can you not clone out the lights?  Otherwise great photo </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Because it was an open challenge, and cloning is not allowed :-)<br/> <br/>-danny</td>', 'Originally posted by Available Light: Hey great shot. Why can you not clone out the lights?  Otherwise great photo   Because it was an open challenge, and cloning is not allowed :-) -danny', '2005-01-21 19:16:04.000000', NULL, 0),
