(1125369, 135523, 22734, '<td valign="top">Even with my bad eye, I have to make an exception and comment on this image just a bit further. I think an injustice has been done. This image deserved a higher placing not only on the superb lighting but the sheer force of the subject matter. I understand the reticence about voters dismissing baby pictures, but the baby here, a very cute one, is merely sharing the billing. Yet look at his little hand! The Godfathers pose and expression are indeed in the classic mode. I do believe that the voters missed the delivery. This goes into my favs and keep up the good work.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-01-22 13:52:04.</i></td>', 'Even with my bad eye, I have to make an exception and comment on this image just a bit further. I think an injustice has been done. This image deserved a higher placing not only on the superb lighting but the sheer force of the subject matter. I understand the reticence about voters dismissing baby pictures, but the baby here, a very cute one, is merely sharing the billing. Yet look at his little hand! The Godfathers pose and expression are indeed in the classic mode. I do believe that the voters missed the delivery. This goes into my favs and keep up the good work.', '2005-01-22 13:50:44.000000', '2005-01-22 13:52:04.000000', 0),
